{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjkYSwqnrQg8gtGxFf5M","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014CHHA43dyDSFA2jxFGK2jn","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat > data/dialogue.js <<'E'\n// Plain data. Add a line here and it's in the game. Picked by situation, without repeats.\nexport const QUESTIONS = [\n  { q: 'Do you trust your knees?', yes: 'They speak highly of you too.', no: 'They know.', a: 'Yes', b: 'No' },\n  { q: 'Do you ever stand on one leg without knowing why?', yes: 'I thought so.', no: \"That's what someone on one leg would say.\", a: 'Yes', b: 'No' },\n  { q: 'Have you been leaning on things? Be honest. I can tell.', yes: 'Thank you for telling me. The things already told me.', no: 'The door frame says otherwise.', a: 'Yes', b: 'No' },\n  { q: 'When you walk into a room, which way do you lean first?', yes: \"Interesting. I'm writing that down.\", no: \"Interesting. I'm writing that down.\", a: 'Left', b: 'Right' },\n  { q: 'Do you think about your ankles as often as they think about you?', yes: 'That is very healthy. For the ankles.', no: 'They will be sad to hear it.', a: 'Yes', b: 'No' },\n  { q: 'Have you ever apologised to a chair?', yes: 'It accepted. I checked.', no: \"You will. It's a process.\", a: 'Yes', b: 'No' },\n  { q: 'When nobody is looking, do you stand up straight?', yes: 'Somebody is always looking. It is me.', no: 'I know. I was looking.', a: 'Yes', b: 'No' },\n  { q: 'Would you describe your posture as a decision?', yes: \"A brave one. I won't ask who made it.\", no: \"No. It's more of a rumour.\", a: 'Yes', b: 'No' },\n  { q: 'Do you know where your feet are right now?', yes: \"Good. Please don't tell them I asked.\", no: \"They're at the bottom. I'll wait.\", a: 'Yes', b: 'No' },\n  { q: 'Have you ever waved back at someone who was not waving at you?', yes: 'We all have. Their arm was just like that.', no: 'Then you have been very lucky, or very careful.', a: 'Yes', b: 'No' },\n  { q: 'Is your left side your favourite?', yes: 'Please keep your voice down. Your right side is here.', no: 'I will let it know gently.', a: 'Yes', b: 'No' },\n  { q: 'If the island tipped toward you, would you take it personally?', yes: 'Good. It is personal.', no: 'That is very mature. It is still personal.', a: 'Yes', b: 'No' },\n];\nexport const D = {\n  trudy: {\n    arrival: [\"Oh! A person. Please step on. Not on me. On the island.\", \"I'm a level, not a bath mat. I am Trudy. Head of Alignment. There is only me.\"],\n    teachLeft: ['Lean left, please. Slowly. You will feel something move.'],\n    teachLeftDone: ['Your other left. No, that was correct. I was testing you.'],\n    teachRight: ['Now lean right. The oranges have opinions about this.'],\n    teachRightDone: ['I can feel that, by the way. All of it. Everywhere.'],\n    teachForward: ['And forward, toward the lighthouse. Gently. It is older than it looks.'],\n    teachForwardDone: ['Very good. You have moved a whole island and you have not even signed anything.'],\n    teachCheckIn: ['Now I will measure you. It takes a moment and it only hurts my feelings.'],\n    morning: [\n      \"Oh! You came back. I wasn't counting. It's been one day, four hours and some minutes.\",\n      'Good morning. Please stand where the morning can see you.',\n      'You look rested. I say that to everyone. It is on the form.',\n      'The island is a little straighter today. Do not let it go to your head. Your head is on crooked as it is.',\n      'Welcome back. I kept your place. It is the low side.',\n      'Good morning. I have prepared some small disappointments and one large one.',\n      'Hello again. I practised saying hello. That was the good one.',\n      'It is a lovely morning. I measured it. It is four degrees off.',\n      'You are here. I am here. The rock is still there. That is three things going well.',\n      'Good morning. Your knees arrived a little before you did.',\n      'I hope you slept level. Nobody here has, but I hope it.',\n      'Please step on. Not on me.',\n    ],\n    absent: [\n      \"It's been three days. The island tilted a bit. I'm not saying those things are connected. They are connected.\",\n      \"You were gone for a while. I didn't mind. I only checked the pier eleven times.\",\n      'Oh, it is you. I had filed you under Historical.',\n      'Welcome back. Your mat has been asking questions and I have been answering them badly.',\n      'Some time has passed. I will not say how much. It was a lot of hours.',\n    ],\n    ask: [\n      \"You can walk to any class on the card. Or ask me, and I'll tell you where it is, and also how I feel.\",\n      'Your classes are on the notice board. So is a note from Kevin about the towels.',\n      'If you are looking for the Bed Hut, it is near the board. It closes when you close your eyes.',\n      \"I don't have a favourite guest. Young Gerald is not my favourite. Neither are you. Not yet.\",\n      'Press the plan button and you can go directly. Walking is better for the island. The island told me.',\n      'The jar is by the lighthouse. Please do not lick it. That rule is new.',\n      'Marbles go in the jar. The jar goes on the low side. It evens out. That is the whole science.',\n      'The lighthouse leans because the island leans. The island leans because it is on one rock. The rock has not been asked.',\n      'Yes, that is my real voice.',\n      'Gary is not a member of staff. Gary has never been a member of staff. He has a badge. I do not know how.',\n      'If you fall down, I write it in the Journal. I call it a Floor Exercise. It is a very popular class.',\n      'The Mirror is by the north fence. It shows you what you look like. I am sorry.',\n      'Lean when you need to. Flail when you must. Bed when I say.',\n      'I can see the whole island from here. I can also see it from over there. It is not a large island.',\n      'You may walk off now. I will wait here and think about what I said.',\n    ],\n    checkinIntro: ['Stand on the mat. This is not a test. It is three tests.', 'Back on the mat, please. I have new numbers to feel strange about.', 'Good. The mat missed you. I told it not to, but it does what it likes.', 'Please step onto the mat. I have sharpened my bubble.'],\n    standStill: ['Stand still. That is all. People find this harder than they expect.', 'Keep the dot in the middle. The middle is that part there. I have heard it is nice.'],\n    leanMatch: ['Lean exactly as much as I say. Not more. I can tell.', 'I will give you a number. Please become that number.'],\n    stepTime: ['Step along with the tick. Left, right. You have done this before. Probably.', 'Alternate your feet with the metronome. Feet are the two at the end.'],\n    quickLean: ['A quarter of the mat will light up. Lean at it. Quickly, but with manners.', 'Lean to the light when it comes. I will be timing you. I am always timing you.'],\n    oneFoot: ['Hold down your right foot and let the left one go. Then do nothing else. It is very hard.', 'Stand on one foot, please. The other one can have the morning off.'],\n    testGood: ['That was nearly level! I got a little emotional. My bubble went sideways.', 'Oh. That was fine. I have written down \"fine\" and underlined it.', 'Nicely done. I am not crying. A level cannot cry. It only drifts.', 'I have seen worse. I have seen it this morning, but I have seen it.'],\n    testBad: ['That was a score. It will be kept with the others.', 'I will put that down as \"a start\". It has been a start for some time.', 'Thank you. I needed something to worry about.', 'That was very brave of your knees.'],\n    drum: ['Your Wobble Age is...', 'Calculating. Please do not look at the numbers. They are shy.'],\n    ageHigh: ['Some of my favourite people are {age}. Mostly the ones sitting down.', 'That is quite a lot of years for one pair of knees.', 'The lighthouse is {age}. You have a lot in common. Please stop leaning on it.', 'That is an age. You have achieved it in a single morning.', \"I didn't ask how old you are. I asked your knees.\"],\n    ageMid: ['A very reasonable number. It has a cardigan and strong opinions about parking.', 'That is the age when you start to make a small noise getting up. You have made it.', \"I didn't ask how old you are. I asked your knees. They said {age}.\", 'A good age. People that age know where the good chairs are.', 'Mid-range. I would describe your balance as \"attending\".'],\n    ageLow: ['That is young. Suspiciously young. Have you been practising when I was not looking?', 'If this continues, you will eventually be born.', 'Goodness. {age}. I am going to need a sit-down, and I have no joints.', 'Your knees have stopped writing to me. I think that is good news.'],\n    ageDown: [\"Your Wobble Age is {age}. That's down from {prev}! If this continues, you will eventually be born.\", 'Down from {prev}. I am not proud. I am a level. But my bubble did move.', 'That is {diff} years younger than yesterday. Please do not tell the others. They will want some.'],\n    ageUp: ['{age}. That is up a little. Some days the years come back to check on you.', 'Up from {prev}. It happens. The number is only visiting.'],\n    planIntro: [\"Here is today's plan. You may do it in any order. I would rather you did not, but you may.\", 'Your classes for today. Walk there, or pick a card and I will arrange a short and confusing journey.', 'Today has some classes in it. I put them there.'],\n    allDone: [\"That is everything on today's card. The Bed Hut is open. Go on. I will stay up and watch the island.\", 'You are finished for today. Please go to bed. You may also stay up and fall over for free.', 'Classes are done. The jar is fuller. The bed is by the board. I did not make it. Nobody makes it. It is wood.'],\n    bed: ['Goodnight. I will keep the island more or less where it is.', 'Sleep well. I will count your breathing, but only because it is there.', 'Off you go. I have left a note on your pillow. It says \"pillow\".', 'Goodnight. I am told most people lie flat. I would love to see it some time.'],\n    bedEarly: ['Not yet. There is still something on the card. I can wait. I have done nothing but wait, at nine degrees.', 'You have classes left. The bed will still be wood later.'],\n    jar: ['Marbles. In the jar. On the low side. Listen to them.', 'There they go. I do not count them. There are exactly that many.', 'That is your morning, in glass. Very nice.', 'Good. The jar is heavier. The island is thinking about it.', 'I like that sound. Please do not tell anyone I like a sound.'],\n    notch: ['Oh! Did you feel that? The island came up a little.', 'The lighthouse looks better. It would never say so.', 'That creak was good news. Most creaks are not.', 'We have come up one notch. The oranges are confused.', 'I think I can see further. It might be nothing. It might be Tuesday.', 'A little straighter. I do not know how I feel about this. I have only ever been at an angle.'],\n    fall: [\"Let's call that a floor exercise.\", 'You fell very consistently. Consistency is important.', 'That was a very honest fall.', 'The ground has noted your interest.', 'I will mark that as \"lying down, advanced\".', 'Please take your time. The floor is not going anywhere. It is the only thing that is not.', 'Lovely clatter. Quite musical.', 'That is one way of finding out where your limbs are.', 'I would have fallen the same way, if I had your commitment.', 'Your arms got there first. Well done, arms.', 'All your pieces are accounted for. I counted. I always count.', 'I felt that in my vial.', 'You are getting very good at the first half of that.', 'Gravity asked you a question and you answered in full.', 'You do not have to do that for me.', 'Up you get. Nobody saw. I saw.'],\n    nearFall: ['Oh! Oh. Fine. Fine.', 'I did not breathe just then. I do not breathe, but I did not.', 'That was nearly a floor exercise.', 'My bubble went all the way to the end. Please do not do that.', 'That was close. I was close to feeling something.'],\n    flail: ['That worked, and I would like it never to happen again.', 'Very undignified. Very effective.', 'I have added that to your file, under \"arms\".', 'Please. People can see you. Keep doing it.'],\n    praise: ['That was nearly level.', 'Your knees should be proud. I have told them.', 'I will allow it.', 'Very tidy. I would frame it, but the frame would be crooked.', 'Yes. That. Do that again, but at some point.', 'I have nothing to correct, and I am a little lost now.'],\n    fruitIntro: ['A barge will fire fruit at you. Please catch it in your hat. This is a wellness activity.', 'The fruit in your hat is not yours until it is in the crate. That is also true of most things.'],\n    fruitSpill: ['All of it. All the fruit. Very generous.', 'The sea thanks you for your contribution.', 'You were so close to having some fruit.'],\n    fruitBank: ['Crate! Very sensible. Boring, and sensible.', 'In the crate. Now it is real fruit.', 'That is a good amount. Greedy people have more, for a while.'],\n    fruitGreedy: ['That is a lot of fruit. I am not saying anything.', 'Your hat is very full. I am only mentioning it.', 'Would you like to put some of that down? No? All right.'],\n    urchin: ['That one was an urchin. Please do not hug it.', 'Not all fruit is fruit.'],\n    boot: ['That is a boot. I do not know whose. It is yours now.', 'A boot. Very good for the ankles, someone once said, wrongly.'],\n    golden: ['A golden pineapple! Please do not get excited. Please get a little excited.', 'That is worth five. It weighs more than it should, like most good news.'],\n    serviceIntro: ['Carry the glasses to the cabana. The guest has been waiting since Thursday.', 'Left foot, right foot. Same foot twice is called a stumble. Also a Tuesday.'],\n    serviceGust: ['Wind coming. Lean into it a little. Only a little.', 'A little breeze. Small leans keep glasses. Big leans give them to the sea.'],\n    serviceSpill: ['That glass has gone to see the world.', 'There goes one. It had a good life, on a tray.', 'Fewer glasses. Lighter tray. I am trying to be positive.'],\n    serviceSplash: ['Splash. The guest did not order that.', 'You have left the boardwalk. Please return to the boardwalk.', 'That is the sea. It is on the sides.'],\n    serviceDone: ['Delivered. The guest says thank you and has changed their order.', 'The table has received your glasses. It is very moved.'],\n    springIntro: ['Bounce, then jump, then think about what you have done. Into the water, please.', 'A clean dive earns Grace. A perfect belly flop earns Splash. Everything else is Technically a Dive.'],\n    springGrace: ['Barely a ripple. I did not know you could be quiet.', 'That was very nearly a person going into water correctly.'],\n    springSplash: ['That was the largest noise anyone has made here. Thank you.', 'Gary has left the sky. A perfect flop. I am so sorry and so proud.'],\n    springMeh: ['That was Technically a Dive.', 'You went in. I will say that for you. You definitely went in.', 'Most of you entered at around the same time.'],\n    raftIntro: ['Everyone is on the same raft. Please try to resolve this as adults.', 'Stay on. Shove if you must. The raft is getting smaller, because it does not love you.'],\n    raftOut: ['Overboard. A very clean exit.', 'That person has chosen the sea.', 'Well, that is one fewer opinion on the raft.'],\n    raftWin: ['Last doll standing. On a shrinking raft. In a wellness retreat. Well done, I suppose.', 'You won. Everyone you know is wet.'],\n    loopAsk: ['While you are running: do you think the sea knows it is round?', 'Would you say your feet are more of a left or more of a right?', 'Have you told the others about your knees? No hurry. Keep running.', 'What is your earliest memory of leaning? Slower, please. Now faster.', 'If you could be any angle, which would you be? I have only tried the one.', 'Do you ever wonder who levels the levels? Mind the shell.', 'I am enjoying the view from your shoulder. Your ear has a lean to it. Slight.'],\n    loopFast: ['Too fast. Kevin is a retired man. Stay behind him.', 'You have overtaken your own good sense.'],\n    loopSlow: ['A little quicker, please. A shell just overtook you.', 'Kevin is getting away. He is not trying to.'],\n    results: ['Thank you for attending.', 'I have written that down. It is permanent.', 'That is a medal. It is made of stamp.', \"You did that. Nobody can say you didn't. I have it in writing.\", 'Very good. I will not be telling you what I really think, which is also very good.', 'Well. You are still here. That is most of it.'],\n    attended: ['You attended. That is the medal. Attendance is the first form of balance.', 'You cannot lose. You can only do it badly. Thank you for the demonstration.', 'Attended. It is a real medal. Please stop looking at it like that.'],\n    exemplary: ['Exemplary. I checked it twice. I checked it a third time for pleasure.', 'That was exemplary. I do not want to alarm you.'],\n    suspicious: ['Suspicious. Nobody is that steady. I will be looking into you.', 'That is the Suspicious medal. It is the best one. Please explain yourself.'],\n    grandStart: ['This is the last notch. Everything you lean, the island leans. Please be careful with it. It is all we have.'],\n    grandEnd: ['Oh.', \"So that's what the middle looks like.\"],\n    grandAfter: [\"It's quite flat, isn't it?\", '...Same time tomorrow?'],\n    gary: [\"He's part of it now.\", 'Please do not feed Gary. Please do not do anything that Gary might interpret.', 'Gary. No. Gary.'],\n    maintenance: ['The island is level. It only needs a little maintenance. Mostly you.', 'Everything is straight now. I do not know what to do with myself. Same time tomorrow?', 'Level again today. I checked at dawn and also several other times.', 'I keep expecting things to slide. They do not. It is very quiet.'],\n    mirror: ['The Mirror is open. It shows you as you are, but with a hat.', 'Marbles open hats. Please do not ask how. The accounting is very strange.'],\n    group: ['There is a Group Class now, at the gazebo. Bring anyone who owns knees.', 'You may invite up to three others. I will need all their names, and I will forget them.'],\n    unlock: ['Something new at The Mirror. I did not choose it. I would have chosen it.', 'You have earned a hat. It is more than most people earn.'],\n    journal: ['Your Journal. I keep it for you. I keep it from you, too, mostly.'],\n    guestIntro: ['Those are the other guests. Nobody knows how long they have been here. Please do not ask them.'],\n    idle: ['I am still here. In case that was the question.', 'You have stopped moving. That is either excellent or a problem.', 'I will just stand here and be correct.', 'The orange by your foot has moved twice. You have moved no times.', 'Take your time. I am only counting it.', 'Are you asleep? It is a very good stance if so.'],\n    tutorialClass: ['Your first class is at the Sun Deck. Please walk there, or pick it from the plan. Ms. Stillwater is expecting you. She has been expecting you for some years.'],\n    backFromClass: ['Welcome back. Your form was a form.', 'You are back. The island noticed.', 'That counted. Everything counts. I count it.'],\n    pauseTip: ['Paused. The sea will wait. It has not got anywhere to be.'],\n    freePlay: ['Extra class. Nobody asked you to. I will be writing that down in a good way.', 'You are allowed to keep going. I find this concerning and I am delighted.'],\n    extraA: ['Lean left. Your other left.', 'If it helps, nobody is looking. It does not help, because I am.', 'The dot is you. Please look after it.', 'A small lean now saves a large lie-down later.', 'I would not say that was wrong. I would say it was yours.', 'That was the correct direction, for someone else.', 'Everything is fine. I am saying that for me.', 'You are doing it now. Do not think about it. You thought about it.', 'A wobble is only a balance that is still deciding.', 'You have very committed ankles.', 'I like how you do not give up. Also how you do not improve. It is consistent.', 'Please do not lean on the staff. I am the staff.', 'You have a lovely centre. I have seen it pass by several times.', 'There is a middle. I have read about it.', 'Slowly. Nobody ever fell over slowly. That is not true. Paul did.', 'Keep going. I will be disappointed either way, and very gently.', 'You have got it now. No. You had it.', 'Please remember to blink. You may also remember to breathe. I will leave the order to you.', 'If you are shaking, it is probably the island. It is not the island.', 'I am only a spirit level. I am also the only one who noticed.'],\n  },\n  stillwater: {\n    intro: ['Breathe in. Breathe out. Not like that, but thank you for trying.', 'Welcome to the deck. Please leave your thoughts by the rail. Someone will throw them away.', 'I have been standing here since before you were tired.', 'We will begin when you have stopped beginning.', 'Hello. I have already seen how this goes. Please continue.'],\n    pose: ['This pose is called {pose}. Feel your weight. Feel it apologise.', 'Now, {pose}. It is older than this deck. So is my patience.', 'Next is {pose}. Your body may ask why. Do not tell it.', '{pose}. Stand as though you have been forgiven by someone you do not like.', '{pose}. There is no wrong way. There is your way, and that is close.', '{pose}. Slowly. A heron has never hurried. A heron has also never been asked to.'],\n    calm: ['If you are shaking, that is only your body leaving.', 'A heron can stand like this for hours. A heron has also never been asked why.', 'Yes. That is what stillness looks like when it is nervous.', 'You are nearly doing nothing. It is very difficult.', 'Let your shoulders go. They will come back. They always do.', 'I have seen a stone do this better. But it had practice.', 'Think of a pond. Not that one.', 'There is nothing you need to do now. Except that. Keep doing that.', 'Your breath is a small tide. Please do not let it get ideas.', 'Good. Good. I said that for the deck.'],\n    breath: ['Hold the breath while the ring grows. Let go when it shrinks. It is the only instruction that has ever worked.', 'Breathe with the ring. The ring has never once been out of breath.', 'In. Out. It is a very old idea and it still holds up.', 'You stopped breathing a moment ago. I did not say anything. I am saying it now.'],\n    wobble: ['You moved. It is all right.', 'You got off the mat. I saw. It is all right. I see everything. It is all right.', 'There is a ripple in you. I will wait.', 'Mm.', 'That was a choice. Most things are.', 'Your left side has made a decision without consulting the others.'],\n    flail: ['I saw your arms. Everyone did. Let us never speak of it.', 'That was a great deal of arm for such a small problem.', 'The rail saw that too.', 'Mm. Birds have wings for a reason. You have those for no reason at all.'],\n    fall: ['You are on the floor now. It is very still there. You have learned something.', 'That is also a pose. We do not teach it.', 'Lie there a moment. It suits you.', 'The deck has received you.', 'Nothing has happened. You have merely changed direction.'],\n    done: ['That will do. It will have to.', 'We are finished. You may go on existing.', 'Thank you. I noticed all of it.', 'You may step off. Slowly. The deck has grown used to you.', 'Good. Do not tell anyone how it felt. They will only want to talk about it.', 'That was very nearly nothing. I mean that kindly.'],\n    stone: ['One more stone. It is only a stone. You are only a person.', 'I shall place this gently. I do everything gently. It is why people are afraid of me.', 'A stone wants to be still. You could learn from it, and it could not learn from you.', 'Here is another. Do not thank me.', 'The stack is alive now. Do not look it in the eye.', 'Up it goes. I have set it exactly where it will cause the most reflection.'],\n    stoneDrop: ['That stone has left. Let it go. It already has.', 'It fell. Stones do. It is the main thing about them.', 'One fewer. The stack has become more modest.'],\n    pond: ['Sit. A dragonfly may come. Do not invite it. It knows.', 'The pond is listening to you move. Move less. It is shy.', 'Do not think about your left knee.', 'Something is coming. If you notice it, it will leave. Do not notice it.'],\n    creature: ['There. It has decided you are a plant. That is the nicest thing anyone will say today.', 'Do not look. It is on your head. Do not look.', 'You have a visitor. Do not offer it a chair.', 'It has chosen you. I would not read too much into it.'],\n    pat: ['There.', 'You did very well. I will deny it.'],\n    scatter: ['They have gone. They will talk about you.', 'Everything has left. It is all right. They left me too, once. They came back.'],\n    final: ['This is the same as all the other times. Only higher.', 'You may breathe. The island is breathing too. I did not ask it to.'],\n    extra: ['A long neck is mostly a way of arriving late.', 'I have never blinked on camera. I do not intend to start with you.', 'I have one good leg and I have made it my whole personality.', 'There is a fish below us. It has no idea about any of this.', 'Do not mistake my stillness for approval. Do not mistake it for anything.', 'I do this every morning. I do not know who it is for.', 'Your breath is loud. It is not a criticism. It is a measurement.', 'When you have finished wobbling, I will still be here. That is not a comfort. It is only true.', 'Some people find this relaxing. I have not met them.', 'I knew a stork who tried this. We do not talk about the stork.', 'If you feel nothing, that is correct. If you feel something, that is also correct, but louder.', 'Please do not try to impress me. Many have. They are in the sea, mostly.', 'That was very nearly a thought. Let it pass.', 'I do not need a mirror. I know exactly what I look like. It is this.'],\n  },\n  bolster: {\n    intro: [\"ALL RIGHT! I don't know what we're doing but we are DOING IT!\", 'GOOD MORNING! Is it morning? WHO CARES! It is YOU!', 'LOOK AT YOU! You have LEGS! BOTH of them! I checked!', \"I have a whistle somewhere. We won't need it. You have ME.\", 'STEP UP, MY FRIEND! I forgot your name and I love you!'],\n    rep: ['YOU\\'RE DOING IT. I don\\'t know what it is, but you\\'re doing it.', 'Your form is a form! That\\'s what form is!', 'DOWN! Now UP! Those are the two directions!', 'I believe in you as much as I believe in lunch.', 'THAT was a rep! Or part of one! I am proud of the part!', 'FOUR! Or seven! Numbers are for people with fewer flippers!', 'SINK! Lovely! And COME BACK! We missed you!', 'Feel the log! The log feels you! You are in a relationship now!', 'THAT\\'S the stuff! I don\\'t know what stuff! THE STUFF!', 'Knees! Do you have them? Use them! They are FREE!'],\n    last: [\"That's the last one! ...THIS one's the last one. I've lied to you and I'd do it again.\", \"ONE MORE! I said that before! It's still true! It will always be true!\"],\n    tired: ['Shaking is just your muscles CLAPPING!', 'That wobble is STRENGTH trying to get OUT!', 'You look terrible! KEEP GOING! I love it!', \"It's meant to feel like that! I think! Nobody has ever complained and lived near me!\"],\n    log: ['The log slid off! Good log! Here, have it back!', 'I GOT IT! I always get it! That is my one skill!', 'That log has been through a lot. So have you! Together again!', 'Whoops! Here! It loves you! Take it!'],\n    fall: ['DOWN IS A DIRECTION! Now try the other one!', 'THAT counted! I am counting it!', \"You hit the ground so HARD! That's POWER!\", 'What a landing! Up! Up! I would help but I am a walrus!', 'Beautiful! Do you need a moment? NO YOU DO NOT!'],\n    done: ['DONE! Probably! I lost count around two!', 'You did SO MANY! Or some! I am weeping! It is sweat! It is both!', 'THAT is what I call a class! I call everything a class!', 'BRAVO! I will remember this forever or until lunch!', 'Good work! Go lie down near something!', 'I forgot to blow the whistle! Consider it blown!'],\n    step: ['AND LEFT! AND RIGHT! YOU KNOW THE REST!', 'The class is following you! Lead them somewhere nice!', 'FEEL THE BEAT! It is in the floor! It is also in me!', 'NICE FEET! You have the best feet here! I say that to all feet!', 'Sixteen! Spotlights! I did not know we HAD spotlights!'],\n    stepMiss: ['Paul fell over! That was your fault and he loves you!', 'Oops! Somebody tripped! We do not look at them!', \"Doesn't matter! The beat came back round! It always does!\"],\n    plates: ['Keep them spinning! Plates want to fly! Let them dream!', 'That one is wobbling! Hips, friend! HIPS!', 'CRASH! Good! We have more! We have SO many plates!', 'Fast for small! Slow for big! That is also my advice for life!', 'Round and round! You are a very expensive washing machine!'],\n    plank: ['A plank is a stand that has given up! HOLD IT!', 'Gary is on you! That means he respects you! Or he does not know!', 'More gulls! You have become a beach! HOLD!', 'Shake them off if you must! I will look at you sadly! Very, very sadly!'],\n    plankFlail: ['You threw off the gulls. They had feelings. I am looking at you now.', 'I saw that. This is me, looking.'],\n    tug: ['HEAVE! It\\'s a Tug of Peace! Pull peacefully! PULL!', 'WAIT for the call! Then HEAVE! That is all of diplomacy!', 'Do not lean too far when they let go! Well. You can. It is very funny.', 'Peace is winning! Keep pulling until everyone agrees!'],\n    tugSit: ['You sat down! Very peaceful! Rope went the wrong way!', 'The Sandras let go! That is how they get you! Both of them!'],\n    loop: ['Follow Kevin! Not too close! He is retired, not dead!', 'Alternate those feet! Left then the other one!', 'Two laps! Or one and a bit! I was not watching! GO!', 'THE PACE! Feel the pace! The pace is called KEVIN!'],\n    extra: ['Hydrate! I do not know what that means! I just shout it!', 'I used to be small! Nobody knows why I stopped!', 'WHO WANTS TO FEEL THINGS? YOU DO!', 'I have never lost a class! I have misplaced several!', 'That is EXACTLY the right amount of effort! I cannot see you but I am sure!', 'Tusks up! That is not for you! That is for me!', 'I once did a thousand reps. Or a hundred! Or lay down! It was a great day!', 'You are my favourite! I have said that to everyone and meant it every time!', 'If you can talk, you are not working! If you cannot talk, tell me!', 'NO PAIN, some gain! A nice amount of gain! Very reasonable!', 'The sea is watching! Show it your ankles!', 'I have counted you three times! You are STILL ONE PERSON!', 'What a day to have a skeleton!', 'BIG INHALE! Oh, I meant me!', 'Excellent! I said that before you did anything so that you would feel prepared!'],\n  },\n  guests: {\n    margaret: ['Oh, lovely, dear. I fell over on Tuesday and it did me the world of good.', 'You are doing better than my husband. He has been on that bench since April.', 'I came here for a weekend. I think. What is a weekend, dear?', 'Mind the oranges. They come for you on the low side.', 'That level is very sweet on you, you know. She told me she was not.', 'I do hope you are eating your— no. I do hope you are standing up.', 'I knitted this. I also knitted the sea. No, I did not.', 'You remind me of my nephew. He is also made of wood.', 'I have got a lovely lean on me now. Forty years, this took.', 'Do try the Sun Deck. The heron has not blinked at me since March.'],\n    kevin: ['Retired, me. From what, I could not tell you.', 'I run the ring road. I do not like it. I just cannot find the end of it.', 'Good pace, that. I had a pace once.', 'Used to be in logistics. Or linoleum. One of the L ones.', 'Lovely day for it. Whatever it is. Have you seen my towel?', 'I have seen the island go up and down. Never seen it stop. Might be nice.', 'Do not let the Sandras get the rope. That is all I will say.', 'I do twelve laps of a morning. Or two. I stop when the shells look at me.', 'The trick is to keep your knees where you left them.', 'Nice to see young people on the beach. Are you young? Hard to tell, with the paint.'],\n    sandra: ['We think you are doing very well.', 'We do. We think that.', 'We agree with the level.', 'We have always been here.', 'We both had the same thought, just then.', 'She is right. She always is. I am also her.', 'We do not let go of the rope first. Except when we do.', 'Do you need an opinion? We have got the one.', 'We tried the raft. We won. We both won. Nobody could tell.', 'We like your hat. We would like it twice.'],\n    paul: ['Whoa. Sorry. Whoa. I am fine.', 'Is it me or— no, it is me.', 'I came here to get steadier. So far I have got a bit more tilted.', 'Whoops. That is the fourth time today. It is only the morning.', 'I have fallen off everything on this island. I fell off the beach once.', 'Do you ever just— whoa. Sorry. What were you saying?', 'They call me Unsteady. I do not know why. Whoa.', 'Do not worry about me. I have got a good relationship with the ground.', 'The walrus says I am improving. He said it from a long way away.', 'I can do the Apologetic Pine. I am doing it now. I think this is that.'],\n    gerald: ['I am ninety-two. They call me Young because of how I carry myself. I do not, much.', 'In my day the island was more on the other side.', 'I have been ninety-two for a long time now. It is going very well.', 'You youngsters and your Wobble Ages. I got mine in the mail.', 'I remember when that lighthouse was a bungalow.', 'I do my own stunts. All of them. Mostly by accident.', 'Sit down? I would never get up. That is why I am always somewhere else.', 'Mine is the wizard hat. I earned it. Do not ask me doing what.', 'I once stood up straight. In 1961. I did not care for it.', 'Say what you like about the gull. I owe him money.'],\n    cheer: ['Oh, well done!', 'Is that allowed?', 'We saw that!', 'Very good, dear!', 'Whoa!', 'Again! Again!', 'Lovely clatter!', 'That is what I came for!', 'Mind your knees!', 'Ooh, nearly!'],\n  },\n};\nexport function linesCount() { const c = {}; for (const who in D) { c[who] = 0; for (const k in D[who]) c[who] += D[who][k].length; } return c; }\nE\nnode -e \"import('./data/dialogue.js').then(m=>console.log(m.linesCount()))\"","description":"Write dialogue data and count lines"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5357,"cache_read_input_tokens":163172,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5357},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4c3cb271-fa3a-4db7-9b9c-5b70edc7a0c6","uuid":"7482863b-6997-41b7-a5fe-6e3e5b4e9b8e","timestamp":"2026-11-05T12:08:37.761Z","request_id":"req_011CgjkYSXXkUptGkHLKw86s","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_014CHHA43dyDSFA2jxFGK2jn":{"command":"cat > data/dialogue.js <<'E'\n// Plain data. Add a line here and it's in the game. Picked by situation, without repeats.\nexport const QUESTIONS = [\n  { q: 'Do you trust your knees?', yes: 'They speak highly of you too.', no: 'They know.', a: 'Yes', b: 'No' },\n  { q: 'Do you ever stand on one leg without knowing why?', yes: 'I thought so.', no: \"That's what someone on one leg would say.\", a: 'Yes', b: 'No' },\n  { q: 'Have you been leaning on things? Be honest. I can tell.', yes: 'Thank you for telling me. The things already told me.', no: 'The door frame says otherwise.', a: 'Yes', b: 'No' },\n  { q: 'When you walk into a room, which way do you lean first?', yes: \"Interesting. I'm writing that down.\", no: \"Interesting. I'm writing that down.\", a: 'Left', b: 'Right' },\n  { q: 'Do you think about your ankles as often as they think about you?', yes: 'That is very healthy. For the ankles.', no: 'They will be sad to hear it.', a: 'Yes', b: 'No' },\n  { q: 'Have you ever apologised to a chair?', yes: 'It accepted. I checked.', no: \"You will. It's a process.\", a: 'Yes', b: 'No' },\n  { q: 'When nobody is looking, do you stand up straight?', yes: 'Somebody is always looking. It is me.', no: 'I know. I was looking.', a: 'Yes', b: 'No' },\n  { q: 'Would you describe your posture as a decision?', yes: \"A brave one. I won't ask who made it.\", no: \"No. It's more of a rumour.\", a: 'Yes', b: 'No' },\n  { q: 'Do you know where your feet are right now?', yes: \"Good. Please don't tell them I asked.\", no: \"They're at the bottom. I'll wait.\", a: 'Yes', b: 'No' },\n  { q: 'Have you ever waved back at someone who was not waving at you?', yes: 'We all have. Their arm was just like that.', no: 'Then you have been very lucky, or very careful.', a: 'Yes', b: 'No' },\n  { q: 'Is your left side your favourite?', yes: 'Please keep your voice down. Your right side is here.', no: 'I will let it know gently.', a: 'Yes', b: 'No' },\n  { q: 'If the island tipped toward you, would you take it personally?', yes: 'Good. It is personal.', no: 'That is very mature. It is still personal.', a: 'Yes', b: 'No' },\n];\nexport const D = {\n  trudy: {\n    arrival: [\"Oh! A person. Please step on. Not on me. On the island.\", \"I'm a level, not a bath mat. I am Trudy. Head of Alignment. There is only me.\"],\n    teachLeft: ['Lean left, please. Slowly. You will feel something move.'],\n    teachLeftDone: ['Your other left. No, that was correct. I was testing you.'],\n    teachRight: ['Now lean right. The oranges have opinions about this.'],\n    teachRightDone: ['I can feel that, by the way. All of it. Everywhere.'],\n    teachForward: ['And forward, toward the lighthouse. Gently. It is older than it looks.'],\n    teachForwardDone: ['Very good. You have moved a whole island and you have not even signed anything.'],\n    teachCheckIn: ['Now I will measure you. It takes a moment and it only hurts my feelings.'],\n    morning: [\n      \"Oh! You came back. I wasn't counting. It's been one day, four hours and some minutes.\",\n      'Good morning. Please stand where the morning can see you.',\n      'You look rested. I say that to everyone. It is on the form.',\n      'The island is a little straighter today. Do not let it go to your head. Your head is on crooked as it is.',\n      'Welcome back. I kept your place. It is the low side.',\n      'Good morning. I have prepared some small disappointments and one large one.',\n      'Hello again. I practised saying hello. That was the good one.',\n      'It is a lovely morning. I measured it. It is four degrees off.',\n      'You are here. I am here. The rock is still there. That is three things going well.',\n      'Good morning. Your knees arrived a little before you did.',\n      'I hope you slept level. Nobody here has, but I hope it.',\n      'Please step on. Not on me.',\n    ],\n    absent: [\n      \"It's been three days. The island tilted a bit. I'm not saying those things are connected. They are connected.\",\n      \"You were gone for a while. I didn't mind. I only checked the pier eleven times.\",\n      'Oh, it is you. I had filed you under Historical.',\n      'Welcome back. Your mat has been asking questions and I have been answering them badly.',\n      'Some time has passed. I will not say how much. It was a lot of hours.',\n    ],\n    ask: [\n      \"You can walk to any class on the card. Or ask me, and I'll tell you where it is, and also how I feel.\",\n      'Your classes are on the notice board. So is a note from Kevin about the towels.',\n      'If you are looking for the Bed Hut, it is near the board. It closes when you close your eyes.',\n      \"I don't have a favourite guest. Young Gerald is not my favourite. Neither are you. Not yet.\",\n      'Press the plan button and you can go directly. Walking is better for the island. The island told me.',\n      'The jar is by the lighthouse. Please do not lick it. That rule is new.',\n      'Marbles go in the jar. The jar goes on the low side. It evens out. That is the whole science.',\n      'The lighthouse leans because the island leans. The island leans because it is on one rock. The rock has not been asked.',\n      'Yes, that is my real voice.',\n      'Gary is not a member of staff. Gary has never been a member of staff. He has a badge. I do not know how.',\n      'If you fall down, I write it in the Journal. I call it a Floor Exercise. It is a very popular class.',\n      'The Mirror is by the north fence. It shows you what you look like. I am sorry.',\n      'Lean when you need to. Flail when you must. Bed when I say.',\n      'I can see the whole island from here. I can also see it from over there. It is not a large island.',\n      'You may walk off now. I will wait here and think about what I said.',\n    ],\n    checkinIntro: ['Stand on the mat. This is not a test. It is three tests.', 'Back on the mat, please. I have new numbers to feel strange about.', 'Good. The mat missed you. I told it not to, but it does what it likes.', 'Please step onto the mat. I have sharpened my bubble.'],\n    standStill: ['Stand still. That is all. People find this harder than they expect.', 'Keep the dot in the middle. The middle is that part there. I have heard it is nice.'],\n    leanMatch: ['Lean exactly as much as I say. Not more. I can tell.', 'I will give you a number. Please become that number.'],\n    stepTime: ['Step along with the tick. Left, right. You have done this before. Probably.', 'Alternate your feet with the metronome. Feet are the two at the end.'],\n    quickLean: ['A quarter of the mat will light up. Lean at it. Quickly, but with manners.', 'Lean to the light when it comes. I will be timing you. I am always timing you.'],\n    oneFoot: ['Hold down your right foot and let the left one go. Then do nothing else. It is very hard.', 'Stand on one foot, please. The other one can have the morning off.'],\n    testGood: ['That was nearly level! I got a little emotional. My bubble went sideways.', 'Oh. That was fine. I have written down \"fine\" and underlined it.', 'Nicely done. I am not crying. A level cannot cry. It only drifts.', 'I have seen worse. I have seen it this morning, but I have seen it.'],\n    testBad: ['That was a score. It will be kept with the others.', 'I will put that down as \"a start\". It has been a start for some time.', 'Thank you. I needed something to worry about.', 'That was very brave of your knees.'],\n    drum: ['Your Wobble Age is...', 'Calculating. Please do not look at the numbers. They are shy.'],\n    ageHigh: ['Some of my favourite people are {age}. Mostly the ones sitting down.', 'That is quite a lot of years for one pair of knees.', 'The lighthouse is {age}. You have a lot in common. Please stop leaning on it.', 'That is an age. You have achieved it in a single morning.', \"I didn't ask how old you are. I asked your knees.\"],\n    ageMid: ['A very reasonable number. It has a cardigan and strong opinions about parking.', 'That is the age when you start to make a small noise getting up. You have made it.', \"I didn't ask how old you are. I asked your knees. They said {age}.\", 'A good age. People that age know where the good chairs are.', 'Mid-range. I would describe your balance as \"attending\".'],\n    ageLow: ['That is young. Suspiciously young. Have you been practising when I was not looking?', 'If this continues, you will eventually be born.', 'Goodness. {age}. I am going to need a sit-down, and I have no joints.', 'Your knees have stopped writing to me. I think that is good news.'],\n    ageDown: [\"Your Wobble Age is {age}. That's down from {prev}! If this continues, you will eventually be born.\", 'Down from {prev}. I am not proud. I am a level. But my bubble did move.', 'That is {diff} years younger than yesterday. Please do not tell the others. They will want some.'],\n    ageUp: ['{age}. That is up a little. Some days the years come back to check on you.', 'Up from {prev}. It happens. The number is only visiting.'],\n    planIntro: [\"Here is today's plan. You may do it in any order. I would rather you did not, but you may.\", 'Your classes for today. Walk there, or pick a card and I will arrange a short and confusing journey.', 'Today has some classes in it. I put them there.'],\n    allDone: [\"That is everything on today's card. The Bed Hut is open. Go on. I will stay up and watch the island.\", 'You are finished for today. Please go to bed. You may also stay up and fall over for free.', 'Classes are done. The jar is fuller. The bed is by the board. I did not make it. Nobody makes it. It is wood.'],\n    bed: ['Goodnight. I will keep the island more or less where it is.', 'Sleep well. I will count your breathing, but only because it is there.', 'Off you go. I have left a note on your pillow. It says \"pillow\".', 'Goodnight. I am told most people lie flat. I would love to see it some time.'],\n    bedEarly: ['Not yet. There is still something on the card. I can wait. I have done nothing but wait, at nine degrees.', 'You have classes left. The bed will still be wood later.'],\n    jar: ['Marbles. In the jar. On the low side. Listen to them.', 'There they go. I do not count them. There are exactly that many.', 'That is your morning, in glass. Very nice.', 'Good. The jar is heavier. The island is thinking about it.', 'I like that sound. Please do not tell anyone I like a sound.'],\n    notch: ['Oh! Did you feel that? The island came up a little.', 'The lighthouse looks better. It would never say so.', 'That creak was good news. Most creaks are not.', 'We have come up one notch. The oranges are confused.', 'I think I can see further. It might be nothing. It might be Tuesday.', 'A little straighter. I do not know how I feel about this. I have only ever been at an angle.'],\n    fall: [\"Let's call that a floor exercise.\", 'You fell very consistently. Consistency is important.', 'That was a very honest fall.', 'The ground has noted your interest.', 'I will mark that as \"lying down, advanced\".', 'Please take your time. The floor is not going anywhere. It is the only thing that is not.', 'Lovely clatter. Quite musical.', 'That is one way of finding out where your limbs are.', 'I would have fallen the same way, if I had your commitment.', 'Your arms got there first. Well done, arms.', 'All your pieces are accounted for. I counted. I always count.', 'I felt that in my vial.', 'You are getting very good at the first half of that.', 'Gravity asked you a question and you answered in full.', 'You do not have to do that for me.', 'Up you get. Nobody saw. I saw.'],\n    nearFall: ['Oh! Oh. Fine. Fine.', 'I did not breathe just then. I do not breathe, but I did not.', 'That was nearly a floor exercise.', 'My bubble went all the way to the end. Please do not do that.', 'That was close. I was close to feeling something.'],\n    flail: ['That worked, and I would like it never to happen again.', 'Very undignified. Very effective.', 'I have added that to your file, under \"arms\".', 'Please. People can see you. Keep doing it.'],\n    praise: ['That was nearly level.', 'Your knees should be proud. I have told them.', 'I will allow it.', 'Very tidy. I would frame it, but the frame would be crooked.', 'Yes. That. Do that again, but at some point.', 'I have nothing to correct, and I am a little lost now.'],\n    fruitIntro: ['A barge will fire fruit at you. Please catch it in your hat. This is a wellness activity.', 'The fruit in your hat is not yours until it is in the crate. That is also true of most things.'],\n    fruitSpill: ['All of it. All the fruit. Very generous.', 'The sea thanks you for your contribution.', 'You were so close to having some fruit.'],\n    fruitBank: ['Crate! Very sensible. Boring, and sensible.', 'In the crate. Now it is real fruit.', 'That is a good amount. Greedy people have more, for a while.'],\n    fruitGreedy: ['That is a lot of fruit. I am not saying anything.', 'Your hat is very full. I am only mentioning it.', 'Would you like to put some of that down? No? All right.'],\n    urchin: ['That one was an urchin. Please do not hug it.', 'Not all fruit is fruit.'],\n    boot: ['That is a boot. I do not know whose. It is yours now.', 'A boot. Very good for the ankles, someone once said, wrongly.'],\n    golden: ['A golden pineapple! Please do not get excited. Please get a little excited.', 'That is worth five. It weighs more than it should, like most good news.'],\n    serviceIntro: ['Carry the glasses to the cabana. The guest has been waiting since Thursday.', 'Left foot, right foot. Same foot twice is called a stumble. Also a Tuesday.'],\n    serviceGust: ['Wind coming. Lean into it a little. Only a little.', 'A little breeze. Small leans keep glasses. Big leans give them to the sea.'],\n    serviceSpill: ['That glass has gone to see the world.', 'There goes one. It had a good life, on a tray.', 'Fewer glasses. Lighter tray. I am trying to be positive.'],\n    serviceSplash: ['Splash. The guest did not order that.', 'You have left the boardwalk. Please return to the boardwalk.', 'That is the sea. It is on the sides.'],\n    serviceDone: ['Delivered. The guest says thank you and has changed their order.', 'The table has received your glasses. It is very moved.'],\n    springIntro: ['Bounce, then jump, then think about what you have done. Into the water, please.', 'A clean dive earns Grace. A perfect belly flop earns Splash. Everything else is Technically a Dive.'],\n    springGrace: ['Barely a ripple. I did not know you could be quiet.', 'That was very nearly a person going into water correctly.'],\n    springSplash: ['That was the largest noise anyone has made here. Thank you.', 'Gary has left the sky. A perfect flop. I am so sorry and so proud.'],\n    springMeh: ['That was Technically a Dive.', 'You went in. I will say that for you. You definitely went in.', 'Most of you entered at around the same time.'],\n    raftIntro: ['Everyone is on the same raft. Please try to resolve this as adults.', 'Stay on. Shove if you must. The raft is getting smaller, because it does not love you.'],\n    raftOut: ['Overboard. A very clean exit.', 'That person has chosen the sea.', 'Well, that is one fewer opinion on the raft.'],\n    raftWin: ['Last doll standing. On a shrinking raft. In a wellness retreat. Well done, I suppose.', 'You won. Everyone you know is wet.'],\n    loopAsk: ['While you are running: do you think the sea knows it is round?', 'Would you say your feet are more of a left or more of a right?', 'Have you told the others about your knees? No hurry. Keep running.', 'What is your earliest memory of leaning? Slower, please. Now faster.', 'If you could be any angle, which would you be? I have only tried the one.', 'Do you ever wonder who levels the levels? Mind the shell.', 'I am enjoying the view from your shoulder. Your ear has a lean to it. Slight.'],\n    loopFast: ['Too fast. Kevin is a retired man. Stay behind him.', 'You have overtaken your own good sense.'],\n    loopSlow: ['A little quicker, please. A shell just overtook you.', 'Kevin is getting away. He is not trying to.'],\n    results: ['Thank you for attending.', 'I have written that down. It is permanent.', 'That is a medal. It is made of stamp.', \"You did that. Nobody can say you didn't. I have it in writing.\", 'Very good. I will not be telling you what I really think, which is also very good.', 'Well. You are still here. That is most of it.'],\n    attended: ['You attended. That is the medal. Attendance is the first form of balance.', 'You cannot lose. You can only do it badly. Thank you for the demonstration.', 'Attended. It is a real medal. Please stop looking at it like that.'],\n    exemplary: ['Exemplary. I checked it twice. I checked it a third time for pleasure.', 'That was exemplary. I do not want to alarm you.'],\n    suspicious: ['Suspicious. Nobody is that steady. I will be looking into you.', 'That is the Suspicious medal. It is the best one. Please explain yourself.'],\n    grandStart: ['This is the last notch. Everything you lean, the island leans. Please be careful with it. It is all we have.'],\n    grandEnd: ['Oh.', \"So that's what the middle looks like.\"],\n    grandAfter: [\"It's quite flat, isn't it?\", '...Same time tomorrow?'],\n    gary: [\"He's part of it now.\", 'Please do not feed Gary. Please do not do anything that Gary might interpret.', 'Gary. No. Gary.'],\n    maintenance: ['The island is level. It only needs a little maintenance. Mostly you.', 'Everything is straight now. I do not know what to do with myself. Same time tomorrow?', 'Level again today. I checked at dawn and also several other times.', 'I keep expecting things to slide. They do not. It is very quiet.'],\n    mirror: ['The Mirror is open. It shows you as you are, but with a hat.', 'Marbles open hats. Please do not ask how. The accounting is very strange.'],\n    group: ['There is a Group Class now, at the gazebo. Bring anyone who owns knees.', 'You may invite up to three others. I will need all their names, and I will forget them.'],\n    unlock: ['Something new at The Mirror. I did not choose it. I would have chosen it.', 'You have earned a hat. It is more than most people earn.'],\n    journal: ['Your Journal. I keep it for you. I keep it from you, too, mostly.'],\n    guestIntro: ['Those are the other guests. Nobody knows how long they have been here. Please do not ask them.'],\n    idle: ['I am still here. In case that was the question.', 'You have stopped moving. That is either excellent or a problem.', 'I will just stand here and be correct.', 'The orange by your foot has moved twice. You have moved no times.', 'Take your time. I am only counting it.', 'Are you asleep? It is a very good stance if so.'],\n    tutorialClass: ['Your first class is at the Sun Deck. Please walk there, or pick it from the plan. Ms. Stillwater is expecting you. She has been expecting you for some years.'],\n    backFromClass: ['Welcome back. Your form was a form.', 'You are back. The island noticed.', 'That counted. Everything counts. I count it.'],\n    pauseTip: ['Paused. The sea will wait. It has not got anywhere to be.'],\n    freePlay: ['Extra class. Nobody asked you to. I will be writing that down in a good way.', 'You are allowed to keep going. I find this concerning and I am delighted.'],\n    extraA: ['Lean left. Your other left.', 'If it helps, nobody is looking. It does not help, because I am.', 'The dot is you. Please look after it.', 'A small lean now saves a large lie-down later.', 'I would not say that was wrong. I would say it was yours.', 'That was the correct direction, for someone else.', 'Everything is fine. I am saying that for me.', 'You are doing it now. Do not think about it. You thought about it.', 'A wobble is only a balance that is still deciding.', 'You have very committed ankles.', 'I like how you do not give up. Also how you do not improve. It is consistent.', 'Please do not lean on the staff. I am the staff.', 'You have a lovely centre. I have seen it pass by several times.', 'There is a middle. I have read about it.', 'Slowly. Nobody ever fell over slowly. That is not true. Paul did.', 'Keep going. I will be disappointed either way, and very gently.', 'You have got it now. No. You had it.', 'Please remember to blink. You may also remember to breathe. I will leave the order to you.', 'If you are shaking, it is probably the island. It is not the island.', 'I am only a spirit level. I am also the only one who noticed.'],\n  },\n  stillwater: {\n    intro: ['Breathe in. Breathe out. Not like that, but thank you for trying.', 'Welcome to the deck. Please leave your thoughts by the rail. Someone will throw them away.', 'I have been standing here since before you were tired.', 'We will begin when you have stopped beginning.', 'Hello. I have already seen how this goes. Please continue.'],\n    pose: ['This pose is called {pose}. Feel your weight. Feel it apologise.', 'Now, {pose}. It is older than this deck. So is my patience.', 'Next is {pose}. Your body may ask why. Do not tell it.', '{pose}. Stand as though you have been forgiven by someone you do not like.', '{pose}. There is no wrong way. There is your way, and that is close.', '{pose}. Slowly. A heron has never hurried. A heron has also never been asked to.'],\n    calm: ['If you are shaking, that is only your body leaving.', 'A heron can stand like this for hours. A heron has also never been asked why.', 'Yes. That is what stillness looks like when it is nervous.', 'You are nearly doing nothing. It is very difficult.', 'Let your shoulders go. They will come back. They always do.', 'I have seen a stone do this better. But it had practice.', 'Think of a pond. Not that one.', 'There is nothing you need to do now. Except that. Keep doing that.', 'Your breath is a small tide. Please do not let it get ideas.', 'Good. Good. I said that for the deck.'],\n    breath: ['Hold the breath while the ring grows. Let go when it shrinks. It is the only instruction that has ever worked.', 'Breathe with the ring. The ring has never once been out of breath.', 'In. Out. It is a very old idea and it still holds up.', 'You stopped breathing a moment ago. I did not say anything. I am saying it now.'],\n    wobble: ['You moved. It is all right.', 'You got off the mat. I saw. It is all right. I see everything. It is all right.', 'There is a ripple in you. I will wait.', 'Mm.', 'That was a choice. Most things are.', 'Your left side has made a decision without consulting the others.'],\n    flail: ['I saw your arms. Everyone did. Let us never speak of it.', 'That was a great deal of arm for such a small problem.', 'The rail saw that too.', 'Mm. Birds have wings for a reason. You have those for no reason at all.'],\n    fall: ['You are on the floor now. It is very still there. You have learned something.', 'That is also a pose. We do not teach it.', 'Lie there a moment. It suits you.', 'The deck has received you.', 'Nothing has happened. You have merely changed direction.'],\n    done: ['That will do. It will have to.', 'We are finished. You may go on existing.', 'Thank you. I noticed all of it.', 'You may step off. Slowly. The deck has grown used to you.', 'Good. Do not tell anyone how it felt. They will only want to talk about it.', 'That was very nearly nothing. I mean that kindly.'],\n    stone: ['One more stone. It is only a stone. You are only a person.', 'I shall place this gently. I do everything gently. It is why people are afraid of me.', 'A stone wants to be still. You could learn from it, and it could not learn from you.', 'Here is another. Do not thank me.', 'The stack is alive now. Do not look it in the eye.', 'Up it goes. I have set it exactly where it will cause the most reflection.'],\n    stoneDrop: ['That stone has left. Let it go. It already has.', 'It fell. Stones do. It is the main thing about them.', 'One fewer. The stack has become more modest.'],\n    pond: ['Sit. A dragonfly may come. Do not invite it. It knows.', 'The pond is listening to you move. Move less. It is shy.', 'Do not think about your left knee.', 'Something is coming. If you notice it, it will leave. Do not notice it.'],\n    creature: ['There. It has decided you are a plant. That is the nicest thing anyone will say today.', 'Do not look. It is on your head. Do not look.', 'You have a visitor. Do not offer it a chair.', 'It has chosen you. I would not read too much into it.'],\n    pat: ['There.', 'You did very well. I will deny it.'],\n    scatter: ['They have gone. They will talk about you.', 'Everything has left. It is all right. They left me too, once. They came back.'],\n    final: ['This is the same as all the other times. Only higher.', 'You may breathe. The island is breathing too. I did not ask it to.'],\n    extra: ['A long neck is mostly a way of arriving late.', 'I have never blinked on camera. I do not intend to start with you.', 'I have one good leg and I have made it my whole personality.', 'There is a fish below us. It has no idea about any of this.', 'Do not mistake my stillness for approval. Do not mistake it for anything.', 'I do this every morning. I do not know who it is for.', 'Your breath is loud. It is not a criticism. It is a measurement.', 'When you have finished wobbling, I will still be here. That is not a comfort. It is only true.', 'Some people find this relaxing. I have not met them.', 'I knew a stork who tried this. We do not talk about the stork.', 'If you feel nothing, that is correct. If you feel something, that is also correct, but louder.', 'Please do not try to impress me. Many have. They are in the sea, mostly.', 'That was very nearly a thought. Let it pass.', 'I do not need a mirror. I know exactly what I look like. It is this.'],\n  },\n  bolster: {\n    intro: [\"ALL RIGHT! I don't know what we're doing but we are DOING IT!\", 'GOOD MORNING! Is it morning? WHO CARES! It is YOU!', 'LOOK AT YOU! You have LEGS! BOTH of them! I checked!', \"I have a whistle somewhere. We won't need it. You have ME.\", 'STEP UP, MY FRIEND! I forgot your name and I love you!'],\n    rep: ['YOU\\'RE DOING IT. I don\\'t know what it is, but you\\'re doing it.', 'Your form is a form! That\\'s what form is!', 'DOWN! Now UP! Those are the two directions!', 'I believe in you as much as I believe in lunch.', 'THAT was a rep! Or part of one! I am proud of the part!', 'FOUR! Or seven! Numbers are for people with fewer flippers!', 'SINK! Lovely! And COME BACK! We missed you!', 'Feel the log! The log feels you! You are in a relationship now!', 'THAT\\'S the stuff! I don\\'t know what stuff! THE STUFF!', 'Knees! Do you have them? Use them! They are FREE!'],\n    last: [\"That's the last one! ...THIS one's the last one. I've lied to you and I'd do it again.\", \"ONE MORE! I said that before! It's still true! It will always be true!\"],\n    tired: ['Shaking is just your muscles CLAPPING!', 'That wobble is STRENGTH trying to get OUT!', 'You look terrible! KEEP GOING! I love it!', \"It's meant to feel like that! I think! Nobody has ever complained and lived near me!\"],\n    log: ['The log slid off! Good log! Here, have it back!', 'I GOT IT! I always get it! That is my one skill!', 'That log has been through a lot. So have you! Together again!', 'Whoops! Here! It loves you! Take it!'],\n    fall: ['DOWN IS A DIRECTION! Now try the other one!', 'THAT counted! I am counting it!', \"You hit the ground so HARD! That's POWER!\", 'What a landing! Up! Up! I would help but I am a walrus!', 'Beautiful! Do you need a moment? NO YOU DO NOT!'],\n    done: ['DONE! Probably! I lost count around two!', 'You did SO MANY! Or some! I am weeping! It is sweat! It is both!', 'THAT is what I call a class! I call everything a class!', 'BRAVO! I will remember this forever or until lunch!', 'Good work! Go lie down near something!', 'I forgot to blow the whistle! Consider it blown!'],\n    step: ['AND LEFT! AND RIGHT! YOU KNOW THE REST!', 'The class is following you! Lead them somewhere nice!', 'FEEL THE BEAT! It is in the floor! It is also in me!', 'NICE FEET! You have the best feet here! I say that to all feet!', 'Sixteen! Spotlights! I did not know we HAD spotlights!'],\n    stepMiss: ['Paul fell over! That was your fault and he loves you!', 'Oops! Somebody tripped! We do not look at them!', \"Doesn't matter! The beat came back round! It always does!\"],\n    plates: ['Keep them spinning! Plates want to fly! Let them dream!', 'That one is wobbling! Hips, friend! HIPS!', 'CRASH! Good! We have more! We have SO many plates!', 'Fast for small! Slow for big! That is also my advice for life!', 'Round and round! You are a very expensive washing machine!'],\n    plank: ['A plank is a stand that has given up! HOLD IT!', 'Gary is on you! That means he respects you! Or he does not know!', 'More gulls! You have become a beach! HOLD!', 'Shake them off if you must! I will look at you sadly! Very, very sadly!'],\n    plankFlail: ['You threw off the gulls. They had feelings. I am looking at you now.', 'I saw that. This is me, looking.'],\n    tug: ['HEAVE! It\\'s a Tug of Peace! Pull peacefully! PULL!', 'WAIT for the call! Then HEAVE! That is all of diplomacy!', 'Do not lean too far when they let go! Well. You can. It is very funny.', 'Peace is winning! Keep pulling until everyone agrees!'],\n    tugSit: ['You sat down! Very peaceful! Rope went the wrong way!', 'The Sandras let go! That is how they get you! Both of them!'],\n    loop: ['Follow Kevin! Not too close! He is retired, not dead!', 'Alternate those feet! Left then the other one!', 'Two laps! Or one and a bit! I was not watching! GO!', 'THE PACE! Feel the pace! The pace is called KEVIN!'],\n    extra: ['Hydrate! I do not know what that means! I just shout it!', 'I used to be small! Nobody knows why I stopped!', 'WHO WANTS TO FEEL THINGS? YOU DO!', 'I have never lost a class! I have misplaced several!', 'That is EXACTLY the right amount of effort! I cannot see you but I am sure!', 'Tusks up! That is not for you! That is for me!', 'I once did a thousand reps. Or a hundred! Or lay down! It was a great day!', 'You are my favourite! I have said that to everyone and meant it every time!', 'If you can talk, you are not working! If you cannot talk, tell me!', 'NO PAIN, some gain! A nice amount of gain! Very reasonable!', 'The sea is watching! Show it your ankles!', 'I have counted you three times! You are STILL ONE PERSON!', 'What a day to have a skeleton!', 'BIG INHALE! Oh, I meant me!', 'Excellent! I said that before you did anything so that you would feel prepared!'],\n  },\n  guests: {\n    margaret: ['Oh, lovely, dear. I fell over on Tuesday and it did me the world of good.', 'You are doing better than my husband. He has been on that bench since April.', 'I came here for a weekend. I think. What is a weekend, dear?', 'Mind the oranges. They come for you on the low side.', 'That level is very sweet on you, you know. She told me she was not.', 'I do hope you are eating your— no. I do hope you are standing up.', 'I knitted this. I also knitted the sea. No, I did not.', 'You remind me of my nephew. He is also made of wood.', 'I have got a lovely lean on me now. Forty years, this took.', 'Do try the Sun Deck. The heron has not blinked at me since March.'],\n    kevin: ['Retired, me. From what, I could not tell you.', 'I run the ring road. I do not like it. I just cannot find the end of it.', 'Good pace, that. I had a pace once.', 'Used to be in logistics. Or linoleum. One of the L ones.', 'Lovely day for it. Whatever it is. Have you seen my towel?', 'I have seen the island go up and down. Never seen it stop. Might be nice.', 'Do not let the Sandras get the rope. That is all I will say.', 'I do twelve laps of a morning. Or two. I stop when the shells look at me.', 'The trick is to keep your knees where you left them.', 'Nice to see young people on the beach. Are you young? Hard to tell, with the paint.'],\n    sandra: ['We think you are doing very well.', 'We do. We think that.', 'We agree with the level.', 'We have always been here.', 'We both had the same thought, just then.', 'She is right. She always is. I am also her.', 'We do not let go of the rope first. Except when we do.', 'Do you need an opinion? We have got the one.', 'We tried the raft. We won. We both won. Nobody could tell.', 'We like your hat. We would like it twice.'],\n    paul: ['Whoa. Sorry. Whoa. I am fine.', 'Is it me or— no, it is me.', 'I came here to get steadier. So far I have got a bit more tilted.', 'Whoops. That is the fourth time today. It is only the morning.', 'I have fallen off everything on this island. I fell off the beach once.', 'Do you ever just— whoa. Sorry. What were you saying?', 'They call me Unsteady. I do not know why. Whoa.', 'Do not worry about me. I have got a good relationship with the ground.', 'The walrus says I am improving. He said it from a long way away.', 'I can do the Apologetic Pine. I am doing it now. I think this is that.'],\n    gerald: ['I am ninety-two. They call me Young because of how I carry myself. I do not, much.', 'In my day the island was more on the other side.', 'I have been ninety-two for a long time now. It is going very well.', 'You youngsters and your Wobble Ages. I got mine in the mail.', 'I remember when that lighthouse was a bungalow.', 'I do my own stunts. All of them. Mostly by accident.', 'Sit down? I would never get up. That is why I am always somewhere else.', 'Mine is the wizard hat. I earned it. Do not ask me doing what.', 'I once stood up straight. In 1961. I did not care for it.', 'Say what you like about the gull. I owe him money.'],\n    cheer: ['Oh, well done!', 'Is that allowed?', 'We saw that!', 'Very good, dear!', 'Whoa!', 'Again! Again!', 'Lovely clatter!', 'That is what I came for!', 'Mind your knees!', 'Ooh, nearly!'],\n  },\n};\nexport function linesCount() { const c = {}; for (const who in D) { c[who] = 0; for (const k in D[who]) c[who] += D[who][k].length; } return c; }\nE\nnode -e \"import('./data/dialogue.js').then(m=>console.log(m.linesCount()))\"","description":"Write dialogue data and count lines"}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014CHHA43dyDSFA2jxFGK2jn","type":"tool_result","content":"{ trudy: 260, stillwater: 83, bolster: 80, guests: 60 }","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4c3cb271-fa3a-4db7-9b9c-5b70edc7a0c6","uuid":"8d6d132e-ad50-44fc-938b-265a1ba16c9b","timestamp":"2026-11-05T12:08:37.937Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"{ trudy: 260, stillwater: 83, bolster: 80, guests: 60 }","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_014CHHA43dyDSFA2jxFGK2jn","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjkkprnhJuyLQWjKy7K7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":13430,"cache_read_input_tokens":168529,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":13430},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4c3cb271-fa3a-4db7-9b9c-5b70edc7a0c6","uuid":"de99904e-1891-433e-89d6-323fc72822a7","timestamp":"2026-11-05T12:08:40.521Z","request_id":"req_011CgjkkpVxvMFEWdbbrB57i","thinking_duration_ms":1430,"thinking_display":"updates"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjkkprnhJuyLQWjKy7K7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Still building. The core, physics, art, input and dialogue are written, so next come the UI shell, the audio engine and the event classes. After that I can run the first build."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":13430,"cache_read_input_tokens":168529,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":13430},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4c3cb271-fa3a-4db7-9b9c-5b70edc7a0c6","uuid":"ea805572-7f46-408f-abb0-77e7cc2a5580","timestamp":"2026-11-05T12:08:40.522Z","request_id":"req_011CgjkkpVxvMFEWdbbrB57i"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjkkprnhJuyLQWjKy7K7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01QyMx9xQdjNHdhKhKeQ2Zoq","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"sed -i \"s/ 'I do hope you are eating your— no. I do hope you are standing up.',/ 'I do hope you are standing up, dear. So many people forget.',/\" data/dialogue.js\ncat > ui/ui.css <<'E'\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\nhtml,body{height:100%;background:#1A1420;overflow:hidden;font-family:Fredoka,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;color:#1A1420;user-select:none;-webkit-user-select:none}\ncanvas#game{position:fixed;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;display:block}\n#hud,#screens,#speechRoot,#toast{position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;font-size:calc(36px*var(--s,1)*var(--vh,1))}\n:root{--vh:calc(1);--wood:#E9D3AE;--paper:#FFF8EE;--ink:#1A1420}\nbody.hidecursor{cursor:none}\n.screen{position:absolute;inset:0;padding:5.5vh 5.5vw;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:2.4vh;pointer-events:auto}\n.screen.dim{background:rgba(26,20,32,.42)}\n.screen.solid{background:#F7E7CC}\n.title-h{font-size:calc(72px*var(--s,1)*var(--vh,1));font-weight:700;color:var(--paper);-webkit-text-stroke:3px var(--ink);paint-order:stroke fill;text-shadow:0 5px 0 var(--ink);text-align:center;line-height:1.05}\n.sub-h{font-size:calc(40px*var(--s,1)*var(--vh,1));background:var(--paper);border:5px solid var(--ink);border-radius:18px;padding:.25em .8em;transform:rotate(-1deg);box-shadow:0 6px 0 var(--ink);text-align:center}\n.grow{flex:1 1 auto;min-height:0}\n.row{display:flex;gap:2.6vw;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap}\n.col{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.6vh;align-items:center}\n.tag{background:var(--paper);border:5px solid var(--ink);border-radius:16px;padding:.35em .9em;box-shadow:0 7px 0 var(--ink);font-size:calc(40px*var(--s,1)*var(--vh,1));cursor:pointer;transition:transform .08s;display:inline-flex;gap:.45em;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;min-width:min(30vw,520px);position:relative}\n.tag:nth-child(odd){transform:rotate(-.9deg)}.tag:nth-child(even){transform:rotate(.8deg)}\n.tag.wood{background:var(--wood)}\n.tag.small{min-width:0;font-size:calc(34px*var(--s,1)*var(--vh,1))}\n.tag.locked{background:#CFC6B4;color:#4A4250}\n.focused{outline:0;background:#FFD23F!important;box-shadow:0 0 0 7px var(--ink),0 12px 0 7px var(--ink)!important;animation:bounce .55s ease-in-out infinite alternate;z-index:3}\n@keyframes bounce{from{transform:rotate(-1.2deg) scale(1.03)}to{transform:rotate(1.2deg) scale(1.08)}}\n.card{background:var(--paper);border:6px solid var(--ink);border-radius:22px;box-shadow:0 9px 0 var(--ink);padding:1.4vh 1.6vw;cursor:pointer;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:.7vh;text-align:center;width:min(25vw,430px);position:relative;font-size:calc(34px*var(--s,1)*var(--vh,1))}\n.card .big{font-size:calc(46px*var(--s,1)*var(--vh,1));font-weight:700;line-height:1.05}\n.stamp{position:absolute;top:-6px;right:-10px;background:#E8443A;color:#FFF8EE;border:4px solid var(--ink);padding:.05em .4em;border-radius:12px;transform:rotate(9deg);font-weight:700;font-size:calc(30px*var(--s,1)*var(--vh,1))}\n.bigcard{background:var(--paper);border:6px solid var(--ink);border-radius:26px;box-shadow:0 10px 0 var(--ink);padding:2.6vh 3vw;max-width:82vw;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:1.5vh;text-align:center}\n.line{font-size:calc(38px*var(--s,1)*var(--vh,1));line-height:1.22}\n.small{font-size:calc(32px*var(--s,1)*var(--vh,1))}\n.promptbar{display:flex;gap:1.6vw;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:calc(30px*var(--s,1)*var(--vh,1));color:var(--paper);-webkit-text-stroke:0;background:rgba(26,20,32,.82);padding:.3em .9em;border-radius:18px}\n.prompt{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.35em}\n.glyph{display:inline-flex;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:.08em}\n.glyph svg{display:block;height:calc(44px*var(--s,1)*var(--vh,1));width:auto}\n.bottomprompts{position:absolute;bottom:3vh;left:0;right:0;display:flex;justify-content:center;padding:0 5.5vw;pointer-events:none}\n.hudnum{position:absolute;top:5vh;right:5.5vw;background:var(--paper);border:6px solid var(--ink);border-radius:20px;padding:.1em .6em;font-size:calc(70px*var(--s,1)*var(--vh,1));font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 7px 0 var(--ink);transform:rotate(1.4deg);text-align:center;min-width:2.5em}\n.hudnum small{display:block;font-size:calc(30px*var(--s,1)*var(--vh,1));font-weight:500}\n.hudtime{position:absolute;top:5vh;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%) rotate(-1deg);background:var(--wood);border:6px solid var(--ink);border-radius:18px;padding:.05em .7em;font-size:calc(58px*var(--s,1)*var(--vh,1));font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 7px 0 var(--ink)}\n.hudbig{position:absolute;top:24vh;left:0;right:0;text-align:center;font-size:calc(96px*var(--s,1)*var(--vh,1));font-weight:700;color:var(--paper);-webkit-text-stroke:4px var(--ink);paint-order:stroke fill;text-shadow:0 6px 0 var(--ink)}\n.hudmsg{position:absolute;top:17vh;left:0;right:0;display:flex;justify-content:center}\n.hudmsg>span{background:var(--paper);border:5px solid var(--ink);border-radius:16px;padding:.2em .7em;font-size:calc(40px*var(--s,1)*var(--vh,1));box-shadow:0 6px 0 var(--ink);transform:rotate(-1deg)}\n.widget{position:absolute;right:5.5vw;top:24vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.2vh;align-items:flex-end}\n.gaugeTag{background:var(--paper);border:5px solid var(--ink);border-radius:14px;padding:.1em .6em;font-size:calc(34px*var(--s,1)*var(--vh,1));box-shadow:0 5px 0 var(--ink)}\n.discwrap{position:absolute;bottom:5vh;left:5.5vw;display:flex;gap:1.5vw;align-items:flex-end}\n.disc{position:relative;display:block}\n.disc svg{display:block;overflow:visible}\n.disc .pname{position:absolute;top:-1.5em;left:0;right:0;text-align:center;font-size:calc(30px*var(--s,1)*var(--vh,1));color:var(--paper);-webkit-text-stroke:0;background:rgba(26,20,32,.82);border-radius:10px}\n#speechRoot .speech{position:absolute;left:50%;bottom:13vh;transform:translateX(-50%) rotate(-.4deg);width:min(70vw,1300px);background:var(--paper);border:6px solid var(--ink);border-radius:22px;box-shadow:0 9px 0 var(--ink);padding:1.4vh 1.6vw 1.7vh;pointer-events:auto;cursor:pointer;font-size:calc(38px*var(--s,1)*var(--vh,1));line-height:1.2;min-height:15vh}\n#speechRoot .speech .who{position:absolute;top:-1.1em;left:1.2em;background:#FFD23F;border:5px solid var(--ink);border-radius:12px;padding:0 .55em;font-size:calc(32px*var(--s,1)*var(--vh,1));font-weight:700;transform:rotate(-2deg)}\n#speechRoot .speech.bark{bottom:auto;top:17vh;min-height:0;pointer-events:none;width:min(60vw,1100px)}\n#speechRoot .speech .next{position:absolute;right:.6em;bottom:.2em}\n#toast .t{position:absolute;top:5vh;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);background:#FFD23F;border:6px solid var(--ink);border-radius:18px;padding:.2em .8em;box-shadow:0 7px 0 var(--ink);font-size:calc(40px*var(--s,1)*var(--vh,1));white-space:nowrap}\n.beam{position:relative;width:min(84vw,1500px);height:calc(30px*var(--vh,1));background:#C89B6A;border:6px solid var(--ink);border-radius:10px;margin-top:16vh;box-shadow:0 8px 0 var(--ink);transform-origin:50% 50%}\n.beam .letters{position:absolute;bottom:100%;left:0;right:0;display:flex;justify-content:center}\n.beam .l{font-size:calc(140px*var(--vh,1));font-weight:700;color:#FFF8EE;-webkit-text-stroke:5px var(--ink);paint-order:stroke fill;text-shadow:0 7px 0 var(--ink);display:inline-block;line-height:1;min-width:.3em;text-align:center}\n.titlepress{position:absolute;bottom:13vh;left:0;right:0;display:flex;justify-content:center}\n.slider{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1vw;min-width:min(60vw,1000px);justify-content:space-between}\n.slider .bar{flex:1;height:calc(26px*var(--vh,1));background:#E9D3AE;border:4px solid var(--ink);border-radius:13px;position:relative;min-width:18vw}\n.slider .fill{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;background:#E8443A;border-radius:9px}\n.slider .val{min-width:3.2em;text-align:right}\n.counter{display:flex;gap:1vw;justify-content:center}\n.counter .wheel{background:#C89B6A;border:7px solid var(--ink);border-radius:18px;font-size:calc(170px*var(--vh,1));font-weight:700;padding:0 .3em;color:var(--paper);-webkit-text-stroke:4px var(--ink);paint-order:stroke fill;box-shadow:0 9px 0 var(--ink);min-width:1em;text-align:center}\n.shelf{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1.4vw;justify-content:center;width:82vw}\n.medal{width:min(18vw,320px);background:var(--paper);border:5px solid var(--ink);border-radius:18px;padding:.35em;text-align:center;font-size:calc(32px*var(--s,1)*var(--vh,1));display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;line-height:1.1}\n.medal .blob{width:calc(62px*var(--vh,1));height:calc(62px*var(--vh,1));border-radius:50%;border:5px solid var(--ink);margin-bottom:.2em}\n.medalstamp{width:calc(250px*var(--vh,1));height:calc(250px*var(--vh,1));border-radius:50%;border:12px solid var(--ink);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:calc(46px*var(--vh,1));font-weight:700;transform:rotate(-8deg);animation:stampIn .35s cubic-bezier(.2,1.8,.4,1);box-shadow:0 8px 0 var(--ink);text-align:center;line-height:1}\n@keyframes stampIn{from{transform:scale(2.6) rotate(10deg);opacity:0}to{transform:scale(1) rotate(-8deg);opacity:1}}\n.calendar{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,1fr);gap:1vw}\n.calendar .d{width:min(10vw,170px);height:calc(120px*var(--vh,1));background:var(--paper);border:5px solid var(--ink);border-radius:14px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:calc(38px*var(--vh,1));position:relative}\n.calendar .d.st::after{content:'✓';position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#E8443A;font-size:calc(90px*var(--vh,1));font-weight:700;transform:rotate(-9deg);opacity:.88}\n.bignums{display:flex;gap:3vw;justify-content:center}\n.bignums .n{background:var(--paper);border:5px solid var(--ink);border-radius:16px;padding:.2em .6em;font-size:calc(34px*var(--vh,1));text-align:center}\n.bignums .n b{display:block;font-size:calc(74px*var(--vh,1));font-weight:700;line-height:1.05}\n.about{max-width:88vw;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1vh;text-align:left;font-size:calc(30px*var(--vh,1));line-height:1.16;background:var(--paper);border:6px solid var(--ink);border-radius:22px;padding:1.5vh 2vw;box-shadow:0 8px 0 var(--ink);overflow:hidden}\n.about b{font-weight:700}\n.bootmsg{position:fixed;inset:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:2vh;color:#FFF8EE;font-size:48px;text-align:center;padding:5vw}\n.bootmsg .wob{width:220px;height:60px;background:#F5B700;border:6px solid #000;border-radius:20px;animation:wob .9s ease-in-out infinite alternate}\n@keyframes wob{from{transform:rotate(-9deg)}to{transform:rotate(9deg)}}\n.mats{display:flex;gap:2vw;justify-content:center}\n.mat{width:min(21vw,380px);min-height:44vh;background:var(--paper);border:6px solid var(--ink);border-radius:26px;box-shadow:0 9px 0 var(--ink);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:1vh;font-size:calc(38px*var(--vh,1));text-align:center;cursor:pointer;padding:1vh 1vw;position:relative}\n.mat .chip{width:calc(90px*var(--vh,1));height:calc(90px*var(--vh,1));border-radius:50%;border:6px solid var(--ink)}\n.swatches{display:flex;gap:1vw;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap}\n.swatch{width:calc(84px*var(--vh,1));height:calc(84px*var(--vh,1));border-radius:50%;border:6px solid var(--ink);cursor:pointer;position:relative;box-shadow:0 5px 0 var(--ink)}\n.swatch.sel::after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:18%;border-radius:50%;background:#FFF8EE;border:4px solid var(--ink)}\n.ribbon{position:absolute;left:50%;bottom:19vh;transform:translateX(-50%);width:min(60vw,1100px);height:calc(120px*var(--vh,1));background:rgba(255,248,238,.92);border:6px solid var(--ink);border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden}\n.ribbon .target{position:absolute;left:10%;top:0;bottom:0;width:8px;background:var(--ink)}\n.ribbon .note{position:absolute;top:50%;width:calc(70px*var(--vh,1));height:calc(70px*var(--vh,1));margin-top:calc(-35px*var(--vh,1));margin-left:calc(-35px*var(--vh,1));border-radius:14px;border:5px solid var(--ink);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:calc(34px*var(--vh,1))}\n.vbar{position:absolute;right:13vw;top:30vh;height:42vh;width:calc(70px*var(--vh,1));background:rgba(255,248,238,.92);border:6px solid var(--ink);border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden}\n.vbar .band{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;background:#9BE38A}\n.vbar .mark{position:absolute;left:-4px;right:-4px;height:10px;background:var(--ink)}\n.hbar{width:min(48vw,860px);height:calc(44px*var(--vh,1));background:rgba(255,248,238,.92);border:6px solid var(--ink);border-radius:18px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}\n.hbar .fill{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;background:#7FD6C8}\n.hbar .mark{position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;width:10px;background:#E8443A}\n.gaugeRow{display:flex;gap:1.4vw;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:center;position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:15vh}\n.arc{position:relative;width:calc(120px*var(--vh,1));text-align:center;font-size:calc(30px*var(--vh,1));color:#FFF8EE}\n.arc svg{display:block;margin:auto}\n.ghosttag{position:absolute;transform:translate(-50%,-100%);font-size:calc(30px*var(--vh,1));font-weight:700;background:var(--paper);border:4px solid var(--ink);border-radius:10px;padding:0 .4em;white-space:nowrap}\n.hoverlabel{position:absolute;transform:translate(-50%,-120%);font-size:calc(36px*var(--vh,1));font-weight:700;background:#FFD23F;border:5px solid var(--ink);border-radius:14px;padding:.05em .55em;white-space:nowrap;box-shadow:0 5px 0 var(--ink)}\n.quad{position:absolute;inset:0}\n.breathring{position:absolute;bottom:5vh;left:calc(5.5vw + 25vh);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:.4vh}\n.podium{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:1vw;justify-content:center}\n.podium .p{width:min(18vw,300px);background:var(--wood);border:6px solid var(--ink);border-radius:14px 14px 0 0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;padding:.3em;font-size:calc(38px*var(--vh,1));text-align:center}\n.warn{background:#E8443A;color:#FFF8EE;border:6px solid var(--ink);border-radius:18px;padding:.2em .7em;font-size:calc(42px*var(--vh,1));font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 7px 0 var(--ink)}\n.devtext{font-size:calc(30px*var(--vh,1));background:var(--paper);border:5px solid var(--ink);border-radius:14px;padding:.4em;white-space:pre-wrap;width:80vw;line-height:1.1;overflow:hidden;max-height:60vh}\n.audioTag{position:fixed;top:1.5vh;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);background:#FFD23F;border:4px solid var(--ink);border-radius:12px;padding:.05em .6em;font-size:calc(30px*var(--vh,1));pointer-events:none}\nE\ncat > ui/focus.js <<'E'\n// Focus across menus: pad, keys and mouse all land on the same thing.\nexport class Focus {\n  constructor(input, audioHook) { this.input = input; this.layer = null; this.cur = null; this.hook = audioHook; }\n  setLayer(layer) { this.layer = layer; this.refresh(true); }\n  items() { return this.layer ? [...this.layer.el.querySelectorAll('[data-focus]')].filter(e => !e.classList.contains('nofocus')) : []; }\n  refresh(toFirst = false) {\n    const items = this.items();\n    if (!items.includes(this.cur) || toFirst) { const want = this.layer && this.layer.el.querySelector('[data-default]'); this.set(want || items[0] || null, true); } else if (this.cur) this.cur.classList.add('focused');\n  }\n  set(el, silent = false) {\n    if (this.cur === el) { if (el) el.classList.add('focused'); return; }\n    if (this.cur) this.cur.classList.remove('focused');\n    this.cur = el; if (el) { el.classList.add('focused'); if (!silent && this.hook) this.hook('move'); }\n  }\n  /** Move to the nearest item in a direction. */\n  move(dx, dy) {\n    const items = this.items(); if (!items.length) return false; if (!this.cur) { this.set(items[0]); return true; }\n    const a = this.cur.getBoundingClientRect(); const ax = a.left + a.width / 2, ay = a.top + a.height / 2; let best = null, bs = 1e12;\n    for (const it of items) {\n      if (it === this.cur) continue; const r = it.getBoundingClientRect(), x = r.left + r.width / 2, y = r.top + r.height / 2, ddx = x - ax, ddy = y - ay;\n      const along = ddx * dx + ddy * dy; if (along <= 4) continue;\n      const across = Math.abs(ddx * dy) + Math.abs(ddy * dx); const s = along + across * 2.2; if (s < bs) { bs = s; best = it; }\n    }\n    if (best) { this.set(best); return true; }\n    return false;\n  }\n  activate(el = this.cur) { if (el && el._act) { if (this.hook) this.hook('ok'); el._act(); } }\n  tick() {\n    const l = this.layer; if (!l) return;\n    const M = this.input.menu;\n    if (this.cur && !this.cur.isConnected) this.refresh(true);\n    if (M.up) this.move(0, -1); if (M.down) this.move(0, 1);\n    if (M.left) { if (this.cur && this.cur._adj) { this.cur._adj(-1); } else if (!this.move(-1, 0) && l.onLeft) l.onLeft(); }\n    if (M.right) { if (this.cur && this.cur._adj) { this.cur._adj(1); } else if (!this.move(1, 0) && l.onRight) l.onRight(); }\n    if (M.confirm) this.activate();\n    if (M.back && l.onBack) { if (this.hook) this.hook('back'); l.onBack(); }\n    if (M.more && l.onMore) l.onMore();\n  }\n}\nE\ncat > ui/ui.js <<'E'\n// DOM overlay: layered screens, tags, glyph prompts, toasts.\nimport { glyphHtml } from '../input/glyphs.js';\nimport { Focus } from './focus.js';\nexport const el = (tag, cls, html) => { const e = document.createElement(tag); if (cls) e.className = cls; if (html != null) e.innerHTML = html; return e; };\nexport const txt = (tag, cls, text) => { const e = document.createElement(tag); if (cls) e.className = cls; if (text != null) e.textContent = text; return e; };\nexport class UI {\n  constructor(input, audioHook) {\n    this.input = input; this.root = el('div'); this.root.id = 'screens'; this.hud = el('div'); this.hud.id = 'hud'; this.speech = el('div'); this.speech.id = 'speechRoot'; this.toastRoot = el('div'); this.toastRoot.id = 'toast';\n    document.body.append(this.hud, this.root, this.speech, this.toastRoot);\n    this.stack = []; this.focus = new Focus(input, audioHook); this.toasts = []; this.device = input.lastDevice;\n    // Hover moves the focus, but only when the pointer actually moved.\n    addEventListener('pointermove', (e) => {\n      if (e.pointerType === 'touch' || !this.input.hoverMoved) return; this.input.hoverMoved = false;\n      const t = document.elementFromPoint(e.clientX, e.clientY); const f = t && t.closest && t.closest('[data-focus]');\n      if (f && this.top() && this.top().el.contains(f)) this.focus.set(f);\n    });\n    addEventListener('click', (e) => { const t = e.target.closest && e.target.closest('[data-focus]'); if (t && this.top() && this.top().el.contains(t)) { this.focus.set(t, true); this.focus.activate(t); } else if (this.onWorldClick && (!this.top() || !this.top().el.contains(e.target))) this.onWorldClick(e); });\n    addEventListener('contextmenu', () => { const t = this.top(); if (t && t.onBack) { if (this.focus.hook) this.focus.hook('back'); t.onBack(); } });\n    this.setScale(1);\n    addEventListener('resize', () => this.setScale(this.scale));\n  }\n  setScale(s) { this.scale = s; document.documentElement.style.setProperty('--s', s); document.documentElement.style.setProperty('--vh', Math.min(innerHeight / 1080, innerWidth / 1920)); }\n  top() { return this.stack[this.stack.length - 1] || null; }\n  topId() { const t = this.top(); return t ? t.id : null; }\n  /** Open a layered screen. build(el, layer) fills it. */\n  open(id, build, opts = {}) {\n    const layer = { id, el: el('div', `screen ${opts.cls || ''}`), onBack: opts.onBack, onLeft: opts.onLeft, onRight: opts.onRight, onMore: opts.onMore, tick: opts.tick, rebuild: null };\n    layer.el.dataset.screen = id; layer.build = build;\n    layer.rebuild = (keepIndex = true) => {\n      const items0 = this.focus.items(); const idx = this.focus.cur ? items0.indexOf(this.focus.cur) : 0;\n      layer.el.innerHTML = ''; build(layer.el, layer); this.refreshGlyphs();\n      if (this.top() === layer) { const items = this.focus.items(); if (keepIndex && items.length) this.focus.set(items[Math.max(0, Math.min(idx, items.length - 1))], true); else this.focus.refresh(true); }\n    };\n    if (opts.replace && this.stack.length) this.close();\n    this.stack.push(layer); this.root.appendChild(layer.el); build(layer.el, layer); this.refreshGlyphs(); this.focus.setLayer(layer);\n    return layer;\n  }\n  close() { const l = this.stack.pop(); if (l) l.el.remove(); this.focus.cur = null; this.focus.setLayer(this.top()); }\n  closeAll() { while (this.stack.length) { this.stack.pop().el.remove(); } this.focus.cur = null; this.focus.setLayer(null); }\n  closeTo(id) { while (this.stack.length && this.topId() !== id) { this.stack.pop().el.remove(); } this.focus.cur = null; this.focus.setLayer(this.top()); }\n  has(id) { return this.stack.some(l => l.id === id); }\n  btn(label, act, opts = {}) { const b = el('div', `tag ${opts.cls || ''}`); if (opts.html) b.innerHTML = label; else b.textContent = label; b.dataset.focus = '1'; b._act = act; if (opts.def) b.dataset.default = '1'; return b; }\n  cardBtn(cls, act, build) { const b = el('div', cls); b.dataset.focus = '1'; b._act = act; build(b); return b; }\n  slider(label, get, set, min, max, step, fmt = (v) => v) {\n    const b = el('div', 'tag slider'); b.dataset.focus = '1'; const l = txt('span', '', label), bar = el('div', 'bar'), fill = el('div', 'fill'), val = txt('span', 'val', '');\n    bar.appendChild(fill); b.append(l, bar, val);\n    const draw = () => { const v = get(); fill.style.width = `${(v - min) / (max - min) * 100}%`; val.textContent = fmt(v); };\n    b._adj = (d) => { const n = Math.round((Math.max(min, Math.min(max, get() + d * step))) / step) * step; set(+n.toFixed(5)); draw(); };\n    b._act = () => b._adj(1);\n    const drag = (e) => { const r = bar.getBoundingClientRect(); const a = Math.max(0, Math.min(1, (e.clientX - r.left) / r.width)); const n = Math.round((min + a * (max - min)) / step) * step; set(+n.toFixed(5)); draw(); };\n    bar.addEventListener('pointerdown', (e) => { drag(e); e.stopPropagation(); bar.setPointerCapture?.(e.pointerId); });\n    bar.addEventListener('pointermove', (e) => { if (e.buttons & 1) drag(e); });\n    bar.addEventListener('click', (e) => e.stopPropagation());\n    draw(); return b;\n  }\n  toggle(label, get, set, on = 'On', off = 'Off') {\n    const b = el('div', 'tag slider'); b.dataset.focus = '1'; const l = txt('span', '', label), v = txt('span', 'val', ''); b.append(l, v);\n    const draw = () => { v.textContent = get() ? on : off; }; b._act = () => { set(!get()); draw(); }; b._adj = () => b._act(); draw(); return b;\n  }\n  choice(label, opts, get, set) {\n    const b = el('div', 'tag slider'); b.dataset.focus = '1'; const l = txt('span', '', label), v = txt('span', 'val', ''); b.append(l, v);\n    const draw = () => { const f = opts.find(o => o[0] === get()); v.textContent = f ? f[1] : ''; };\n    b._adj = (d) => { const i = opts.findIndex(o => o[0] === get()); set(opts[(i + d + opts.length) % opts.length][0]); draw(); }; b._act = () => b._adj(1); draw(); return b;\n  }\n  /** A prompt: verb glyph + words. Re-renders the same frame the device changes. */\n  promptEl(verb, words) { const p = el('span', 'prompt'); const g = el('span', 'pg'); g.dataset.verb = verb; p.append(g, txt('span', '', words)); return p; }\n  promptBar(list) { const bar = el('div', 'promptbar'); for (const [v, w] of list) bar.appendChild(this.promptEl(v, w)); return bar; }\n  bottom(list) { const b = el('div', 'bottomprompts'); b.appendChild(this.promptBar(list)); return b; }\n  refreshGlyphs(root = document) { const d = this.input.lastDevice; for (const n of root.querySelectorAll('[data-verb]')) n.innerHTML = glyphHtml(n.dataset.verb, d); }\n  toast(text, sec = 2.4) { const t = txt('div', 't', text); this.toastRoot.appendChild(t); this.toasts.push({ t, left: sec }); }\n  tick(dt) {\n    for (let i = this.toasts.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) { const o = this.toasts[i]; o.left -= dt; if (o.left <= 0) { o.t.remove(); this.toasts.splice(i, 1); } }\n    const t = this.top(); if (t && t.tick) t.tick(dt);\n    if (this.top()) this.focus.tick(dt);\n  }\n}\nE\ncat > ui/disc.js <<'E'\n// The Balance Disc: the game's signature HUD. Inline SVG, moved with transforms each frame.\nconst NS = 'http://www.w3.org/2000/svg';\nconst S = (t, a, p) => { const e = document.createElementNS(NS, t); for (const k in a) e.setAttribute(k, a[k]); if (p) p.appendChild(e); return e; };\nexport class Disc {\n  constructor(parent, sizeVh, name, colour) {\n    this.el = document.createElement('div'); this.el.className = 'disc';\n    const px = Math.round(innerHeight * sizeVh / 100); const R = 100;\n    const svg = S('svg', { viewBox: '-112 -112 224 224', width: px, height: px }); this.el.appendChild(svg);\n    S('circle', { r: R + 6, fill: '#FFF8EE', stroke: '#1A1420', 'stroke-width': 7 }, svg);\n    for (const r of [75, 50, 25]) S('circle', { r, fill: 'none', stroke: '#CDBFA8', 'stroke-width': 2.5 }, svg);\n    S('path', { d: 'M-100 0H100M0-100V100', stroke: '#CDBFA8', 'stroke-width': 2.5 }, svg);\n    this.zone = S('circle', { r: 30, fill: '#CDEBB8', stroke: '#2E8B57', 'stroke-width': 4, 'stroke-dasharray': '8 5', visibility: 'hidden' }, svg);\n    this.brace = S('circle', { r: 22, fill: '#9BE38A', stroke: '#1A1420', 'stroke-width': 3, visibility: 'hidden' }, svg);\n    this.trailG = S('polyline', { fill: 'none', stroke: '#1A1420', 'stroke-width': 3, 'stroke-opacity': .55, 'stroke-linejoin': 'round' }, svg);\n    this.ring = S('circle', { r: 15, fill: 'none', stroke: '#E8443A', 'stroke-width': 4.5 }, svg);\n    this.dot = S('circle', { r: 13, fill: colour || '#E8443A', stroke: '#1A1420', 'stroke-width': 4.5 }, svg);\n    if (name) { const n = document.createElement('div'); n.className = 'pname'; n.textContent = name; this.el.appendChild(n); }\n    // Trudy peeks over the rim.\n    const t = S('g', { transform: 'translate(0,-112)' }, svg); this.trudy = t;\n    S('rect', { x: -36, y: -18, width: 72, height: 28, rx: 8, fill: '#F5B700', stroke: '#1A1420', 'stroke-width': 4 }, t);\n    S('rect', { x: -21, y: -11, width: 42, height: 14, rx: 7, fill: '#B9F26B', stroke: '#1A1420', 'stroke-width': 3 }, t);\n    this.bubble = S('circle', { r: 5.5, cy: -4, fill: '#fff', stroke: '#1A1420', 'stroke-width': 2.5 }, t);\n    parent.appendChild(this.el); this.trail = []; this.tT = 0;\n  }\n  update(dt, cobX, cobZ, wishX, wishZ, zone, brace) {\n    const R = 100, cx = Math.max(-1.1, Math.min(1.1, cobX)) * R, cz = Math.max(-1.1, Math.min(1.1, cobZ)) * R;\n    this.dot.setAttribute('transform', `translate(${cx.toFixed(1)},${cz.toFixed(1)})`);\n    this.ring.setAttribute('transform', `translate(${(wishX * R).toFixed(1)},${(wishZ * R).toFixed(1)})`);\n    this.tT += dt; if (this.tT > .03) { this.tT = 0; this.trail.push(`${cx.toFixed(0)},${cz.toFixed(0)}`); if (this.trail.length > 16) this.trail.shift(); this.trailG.setAttribute('points', this.trail.join(' ')); }\n    if (zone) {\n      this.zone.setAttribute('visibility', 'visible'); this.zone.setAttribute('r', (zone.r * R).toFixed(1)); this.zone.setAttribute('cx', (zone.x * R).toFixed(1)); this.zone.setAttribute('cy', (zone.z * R).toFixed(1));\n      const inz = Math.hypot(cobX - zone.x, cobZ - zone.z) <= zone.r; this.zone.setAttribute('fill', inz ? '#8FE07A' : '#F1E3CC');\n    } else this.zone.setAttribute('visibility', 'hidden');\n    if (brace) { this.brace.setAttribute('visibility', 'visible'); this.brace.setAttribute('cx', (brace.x * R).toFixed(1)); this.brace.setAttribute('cy', (brace.z * R).toFixed(1)); } else this.brace.setAttribute('visibility', 'hidden');\n    this.bubble.setAttribute('cx', (Math.max(-1, Math.min(1, -cobX)) * 14).toFixed(1));\n  }\n  remove() { this.el.remove(); }\n}\nE\ncat > ui/speech.js <<'E'\n// A paper speech tag in the lower third, text typing out in time with the voice. Everything spoken is on screen.\nimport { el, txt } from './ui.js';\nexport const SPEAKERS = { trudy: { name: 'Trudy', rate: 16 }, stillwater: { name: 'Ms. Stillwater', rate: 7 }, bolster: { name: 'Coach Bolster', rate: 11 }, margaret: { name: 'Gentle Margaret', rate: 12 }, kevin: { name: 'Retired Kevin', rate: 12 }, sandra: { name: 'Both Sandras', rate: 12 }, paul: { name: 'Unsteady Paul', rate: 12 }, gerald: { name: 'Young Gerald', rate: 12 } };\nexport class Speech {\n  constructor(ui, input, audio) { this.ui = ui; this.input = input; this.audio = audio; this.cur = null; this.queue = []; this.barkT = 0; this.lastText = ''; this.spoken = 0; }\n  get busy() { return !!this.cur && !this.cur.bark; }\n  /** Blocking line: Use advances. Returns the line record; `done` turns true. */\n  say(who, text) { const r = { who, text, bark: false, done: false }; this.queue.push(r); if (!this.cur) this.next(); return r; }\n  bark(who, text, sec = 3.2) { if (this.cur && !this.cur.bark) return null; const r = { who, text, bark: true, sec, done: false }; if (this.cur) this.finish(); this.cur = null; this.show(r); return r; }\n  next() { const r = this.queue.shift(); if (r) this.show(r); }\n  show(r) {\n    this.clearDom(); this.cur = r; this.spoken++; this.lastText = r.text;\n    const sp = SPEAKERS[r.who] || { name: r.who, rate: 12 };\n    const box = el('div', `speech ${r.bark ? 'bark' : ''}`); box.appendChild(txt('div', 'who', sp.name));\n    r.tEl = txt('div', 'text', ''); box.appendChild(r.tEl);\n    if (!r.bark) { const n = el('div', 'next'); const g = el('span'); g.dataset.verb = 'use'; n.appendChild(g); box.appendChild(n); box.addEventListener('click', (e) => { e.stopPropagation(); this.advance(); }); }\n    this.ui.speech.appendChild(box); this.ui.refreshGlyphs(box); this.box = box;\n    r.shown = 0; r.t = 0; r.age = 0; r.rate = sp.rate * 1.6;\n    if (this.audio) this.audio.speak(r.who, r.text);\n  }\n  advance() {\n    const r = this.cur; if (!r) return;\n    if (r.shown < r.text.length) { r.shown = r.text.length; r.tEl.textContent = r.text; return; }\n    this.finish();\n  }\n  finish() { const r = this.cur; if (r) r.done = true; this.clearDom(); this.cur = null; if (this.queue.length) this.next(); }\n  clearDom() { if (this.box) { this.box.remove(); this.box = null; } }\n  clear() { this.queue.length = 0; if (this.cur) this.cur.done = true; this.cur = null; this.clearDom(); if (this.audio) this.audio.hushVoice?.(); }\n  tick(dt, menuTop) {\n    const r = this.cur; if (!r) return;\n    r.age += dt;\n    if (r.shown < r.text.length) { r.t += dt * r.rate; const n = Math.min(r.text.length, Math.floor(r.t)); if (n !== r.shown) { r.shown = n; r.tEl.textContent = r.text.slice(0, n); } }\n    if (r.bark) { if (r.age > r.sec + r.text.length / r.rate) this.finish(); return; }\n    if (!menuTop && (this.input.merged.use || this.input.merged.hop) && r.age > .1) this.advance();\n  }\n}\nE\necho ok","description":"Write UI CSS, screen framework, focus, disc and speech"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":13430,"cache_read_input_tokens":168529,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":13430},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4c3cb271-fa3a-4db7-9b9c-5b70edc7a0c6","uuid":"e556f062-5ecc-4add-9813-9f72e5266f53","timestamp":"2026-11-05T12:10:32.001Z","request_id":"req_011CgjkkpVxvMFEWdbbrB57i","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01QyMx9xQdjNHdhKhKeQ2Zoq":{"command":"sed -i \"s/ 'I do hope you are eating your— no. I do hope you are standing up.',/ 'I do hope you are standing up, dear. So many people forget.',/\" data/dialogue.js\ncat > ui/ui.css <<'E'\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\nhtml,body{height:100%;background:#1A1420;overflow:hidden;font-family:Fredoka,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;color:#1A1420;user-select:none;-webkit-user-select:none}\ncanvas#game{position:fixed;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;display:block}\n#hud,#screens,#speechRoot,#toast{position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;font-size:calc(36px*var(--s,1)*var(--vh,1))}\n:root{--vh:calc(1);--wood:#E9D3AE;--paper:#FFF8EE;--ink:#1A1420}\nbody.hidecursor{cursor:none}\n.screen{position:absolute;inset:0;padding:5.5vh 5.5vw;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:2.4vh;pointer-events:auto}\n.screen.dim{background:rgba(26,20,32,.42)}\n.screen.solid{background:#F7E7CC}\n.title-h{font-size:calc(72px*var(--s,1)*var(--vh,1));font-weight:700;color:var(--paper);-webkit-text-stroke:3px var(--ink);paint-order:stroke fill;text-shadow:0 5px 0 var(--ink);text-align:center;line-height:1.05}\n.sub-h{font-size:calc(40px*var(--s,1)*var(--vh,1));background:var(--paper);border:5px solid var(--ink);border-radius:18px;padding:.25em .8em;transform:rotate(-1deg);box-shadow:0 6px 0 var(--ink);text-align:center}\n.grow{flex:1 1 auto;min-height:0}\n.row{display:flex;gap:2.6vw;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap}\n.col{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.6vh;align-items:center}\n.tag{background:var(--paper);border:5px solid var(--ink);border-radius:16px;padding:.35em .9em;box-shadow:0 7px 0 var(--ink);font-size:calc(40px*var(--s,1)*var(--vh,1));cursor:pointer;transition:transform .08s;display:inline-flex;gap:.45em;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;min-width:min(30vw,520px);position:relative}\n.tag:nth-child(odd){transform:rotate(-.9deg)}.tag:nth-child(even){transform:rotate(.8deg)}\n.tag.wood{background:var(--wood)}\n.tag.small{min-width:0;font-size:calc(34px*var(--s,1)*var(--vh,1))}\n.tag.locked{background:#CFC6B4;color:#4A4250}\n.focused{outline:0;background:#FFD23F!important;box-shadow:0 0 0 7px var(--ink),0 12px 0 7px var(--ink)!important;animation:bounce .55s ease-in-out infinite alternate;z-index:3}\n@keyframes bounce{from{transform:rotate(-1.2deg) scale(1.03)}to{transform:rotate(1.2deg) scale(1.08)}}\n.card{background:var(--paper);border:6px solid var(--ink);border-radius:22px;box-shadow:0 9px 0 var(--ink);padding:1.4vh 1.6vw;cursor:pointer;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:.7vh;text-align:center;width:min(25vw,430px);position:relative;font-size:calc(34px*var(--s,1)*var(--vh,1))}\n.card .big{font-size:calc(46px*var(--s,1)*var(--vh,1));font-weight:700;line-height:1.05}\n.stamp{position:absolute;top:-6px;right:-10px;background:#E8443A;color:#FFF8EE;border:4px solid var(--ink);padding:.05em .4em;border-radius:12px;transform:rotate(9deg);font-weight:700;font-size:calc(30px*var(--s,1)*var(--vh,1))}\n.bigcard{background:var(--paper);border:6px solid var(--ink);border-radius:26px;box-shadow:0 10px 0 var(--ink);padding:2.6vh 3vw;max-width:82vw;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:1.5vh;text-align:center}\n.line{font-size:calc(38px*var(--s,1)*var(--vh,1));line-height:1.22}\n.small{font-size:calc(32px*var(--s,1)*var(--vh,1))}\n.promptbar{display:flex;gap:1.6vw;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:calc(30px*var(--s,1)*var(--vh,1));color:var(--paper);-webkit-text-stroke:0;background:rgba(26,20,32,.82);padding:.3em .9em;border-radius:18px}\n.prompt{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.35em}\n.glyph{display:inline-flex;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:.08em}\n.glyph svg{display:block;height:calc(44px*var(--s,1)*var(--vh,1));width:auto}\n.bottomprompts{position:absolute;bottom:3vh;left:0;right:0;display:flex;justify-content:center;padding:0 5.5vw;pointer-events:none}\n.hudnum{position:absolute;top:5vh;right:5.5vw;background:var(--paper);border:6px solid var(--ink);border-radius:20px;padding:.1em .6em;font-size:calc(70px*var(--s,1)*var(--vh,1));font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 7px 0 var(--ink);transform:rotate(1.4deg);text-align:center;min-width:2.5em}\n.hudnum small{display:block;font-size:calc(30px*var(--s,1)*var(--vh,1));font-weight:500}\n.hudtime{position:absolute;top:5vh;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%) rotate(-1deg);background:var(--wood);border:6px solid var(--ink);border-radius:18px;padding:.05em .7em;font-size:calc(58px*var(--s,1)*var(--vh,1));font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 7px 0 var(--ink)}\n.hudbig{position:absolute;top:24vh;left:0;right:0;text-align:center;font-size:calc(96px*var(--s,1)*var(--vh,1));font-weight:700;color:var(--paper);-webkit-text-stroke:4px var(--ink);paint-order:stroke fill;text-shadow:0 6px 0 var(--ink)}\n.hudmsg{position:absolute;top:17vh;left:0;right:0;display:flex;justify-content:center}\n.hudmsg>span{background:var(--paper);border:5px solid var(--ink);border-radius:16px;padding:.2em .7em;font-size:calc(40px*var(--s,1)*var(--vh,1));box-shadow:0 6px 0 var(--ink);transform:rotate(-1deg)}\n.widget{position:absolute;right:5.5vw;top:24vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.2vh;align-items:flex-end}\n.gaugeTag{background:var(--paper);border:5px solid var(--ink);border-radius:14px;padding:.1em .6em;font-size:calc(34px*var(--s,1)*var(--vh,1));box-shadow:0 5px 0 var(--ink)}\n.discwrap{position:absolute;bottom:5vh;left:5.5vw;display:flex;gap:1.5vw;align-items:flex-end}\n.disc{position:relative;display:block}\n.disc svg{display:block;overflow:visible}\n.disc .pname{position:absolute;top:-1.5em;left:0;right:0;text-align:center;font-size:calc(30px*var(--s,1)*var(--vh,1));color:var(--paper);-webkit-text-stroke:0;background:rgba(26,20,32,.82);border-radius:10px}\n#speechRoot .speech{position:absolute;left:50%;bottom:13vh;transform:translateX(-50%) rotate(-.4deg);width:min(70vw,1300px);background:var(--paper);border:6px solid var(--ink);border-radius:22px;box-shadow:0 9px 0 var(--ink);padding:1.4vh 1.6vw 1.7vh;pointer-events:auto;cursor:pointer;font-size:calc(38px*var(--s,1)*var(--vh,1));line-height:1.2;min-height:15vh}\n#speechRoot .speech .who{position:absolute;top:-1.1em;left:1.2em;background:#FFD23F;border:5px solid var(--ink);border-radius:12px;padding:0 .55em;font-size:calc(32px*var(--s,1)*var(--vh,1));font-weight:700;transform:rotate(-2deg)}\n#speechRoot .speech.bark{bottom:auto;top:17vh;min-height:0;pointer-events:none;width:min(60vw,1100px)}\n#speechRoot .speech .next{position:absolute;right:.6em;bottom:.2em}\n#toast .t{position:absolute;top:5vh;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);background:#FFD23F;border:6px solid var(--ink);border-radius:18px;padding:.2em .8em;box-shadow:0 7px 0 var(--ink);font-size:calc(40px*var(--s,1)*var(--vh,1));white-space:nowrap}\n.beam{position:relative;width:min(84vw,1500px);height:calc(30px*var(--vh,1));background:#C89B6A;border:6px solid var(--ink);border-radius:10px;margin-top:16vh;box-shadow:0 8px 0 var(--ink);transform-origin:50% 50%}\n.beam .letters{position:absolute;bottom:100%;left:0;right:0;display:flex;justify-content:center}\n.beam .l{font-size:calc(140px*var(--vh,1));font-weight:700;color:#FFF8EE;-webkit-text-stroke:5px var(--ink);paint-order:stroke fill;text-shadow:0 7px 0 var(--ink);display:inline-block;line-height:1;min-width:.3em;text-align:center}\n.titlepress{position:absolute;bottom:13vh;left:0;right:0;display:flex;justify-content:center}\n.slider{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1vw;min-width:min(60vw,1000px);justify-content:space-between}\n.slider .bar{flex:1;height:calc(26px*var(--vh,1));background:#E9D3AE;border:4px solid var(--ink);border-radius:13px;position:relative;min-width:18vw}\n.slider .fill{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;background:#E8443A;border-radius:9px}\n.slider .val{min-width:3.2em;text-align:right}\n.counter{display:flex;gap:1vw;justify-content:center}\n.counter .wheel{background:#C89B6A;border:7px solid var(--ink);border-radius:18px;font-size:calc(170px*var(--vh,1));font-weight:700;padding:0 .3em;color:var(--paper);-webkit-text-stroke:4px var(--ink);paint-order:stroke fill;box-shadow:0 9px 0 var(--ink);min-width:1em;text-align:center}\n.shelf{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1.4vw;justify-content:center;width:82vw}\n.medal{width:min(18vw,320px);background:var(--paper);border:5px solid var(--ink);border-radius:18px;padding:.35em;text-align:center;font-size:calc(32px*var(--s,1)*var(--vh,1));display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;line-height:1.1}\n.medal .blob{width:calc(62px*var(--vh,1));height:calc(62px*var(--vh,1));border-radius:50%;border:5px solid var(--ink);margin-bottom:.2em}\n.medalstamp{width:calc(250px*var(--vh,1));height:calc(250px*var(--vh,1));border-radius:50%;border:12px solid var(--ink);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:calc(46px*var(--vh,1));font-weight:700;transform:rotate(-8deg);animation:stampIn .35s cubic-bezier(.2,1.8,.4,1);box-shadow:0 8px 0 var(--ink);text-align:center;line-height:1}\n@keyframes stampIn{from{transform:scale(2.6) rotate(10deg);opacity:0}to{transform:scale(1) rotate(-8deg);opacity:1}}\n.calendar{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,1fr);gap:1vw}\n.calendar .d{width:min(10vw,170px);height:calc(120px*var(--vh,1));background:var(--paper);border:5px solid var(--ink);border-radius:14px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:calc(38px*var(--vh,1));position:relative}\n.calendar .d.st::after{content:'✓';position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#E8443A;font-size:calc(90px*var(--vh,1));font-weight:700;transform:rotate(-9deg);opacity:.88}\n.bignums{display:flex;gap:3vw;justify-content:center}\n.bignums .n{background:var(--paper);border:5px solid var(--ink);border-radius:16px;padding:.2em .6em;font-size:calc(34px*var(--vh,1));text-align:center}\n.bignums .n b{display:block;font-size:calc(74px*var(--vh,1));font-weight:700;line-height:1.05}\n.about{max-width:88vw;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1vh;text-align:left;font-size:calc(30px*var(--vh,1));line-height:1.16;background:var(--paper);border:6px solid var(--ink);border-radius:22px;padding:1.5vh 2vw;box-shadow:0 8px 0 var(--ink);overflow:hidden}\n.about b{font-weight:700}\n.bootmsg{position:fixed;inset:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:2vh;color:#FFF8EE;font-size:48px;text-align:center;padding:5vw}\n.bootmsg .wob{width:220px;height:60px;background:#F5B700;border:6px solid #000;border-radius:20px;animation:wob .9s ease-in-out infinite alternate}\n@keyframes wob{from{transform:rotate(-9deg)}to{transform:rotate(9deg)}}\n.mats{display:flex;gap:2vw;justify-content:center}\n.mat{width:min(21vw,380px);min-height:44vh;background:var(--paper);border:6px solid var(--ink);border-radius:26px;box-shadow:0 9px 0 var(--ink);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:1vh;font-size:calc(38px*var(--vh,1));text-align:center;cursor:pointer;padding:1vh 1vw;position:relative}\n.mat .chip{width:calc(90px*var(--vh,1));height:calc(90px*var(--vh,1));border-radius:50%;border:6px solid var(--ink)}\n.swatches{display:flex;gap:1vw;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap}\n.swatch{width:calc(84px*var(--vh,1));height:calc(84px*var(--vh,1));border-radius:50%;border:6px solid var(--ink);cursor:pointer;position:relative;box-shadow:0 5px 0 var(--ink)}\n.swatch.sel::after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:18%;border-radius:50%;background:#FFF8EE;border:4px solid var(--ink)}\n.ribbon{position:absolute;left:50%;bottom:19vh;transform:translateX(-50%);width:min(60vw,1100px);height:calc(120px*var(--vh,1));background:rgba(255,248,238,.92);border:6px solid var(--ink);border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden}\n.ribbon .target{position:absolute;left:10%;top:0;bottom:0;width:8px;background:var(--ink)}\n.ribbon .note{position:absolute;top:50%;width:calc(70px*var(--vh,1));height:calc(70px*var(--vh,1));margin-top:calc(-35px*var(--vh,1));margin-left:calc(-35px*var(--vh,1));border-radius:14px;border:5px solid var(--ink);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:calc(34px*var(--vh,1))}\n.vbar{position:absolute;right:13vw;top:30vh;height:42vh;width:calc(70px*var(--vh,1));background:rgba(255,248,238,.92);border:6px solid var(--ink);border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden}\n.vbar .band{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;background:#9BE38A}\n.vbar .mark{position:absolute;left:-4px;right:-4px;height:10px;background:var(--ink)}\n.hbar{width:min(48vw,860px);height:calc(44px*var(--vh,1));background:rgba(255,248,238,.92);border:6px solid var(--ink);border-radius:18px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}\n.hbar .fill{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;background:#7FD6C8}\n.hbar .mark{position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;width:10px;background:#E8443A}\n.gaugeRow{display:flex;gap:1.4vw;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:center;position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:15vh}\n.arc{position:relative;width:calc(120px*var(--vh,1));text-align:center;font-size:calc(30px*var(--vh,1));color:#FFF8EE}\n.arc svg{display:block;margin:auto}\n.ghosttag{position:absolute;transform:translate(-50%,-100%);font-size:calc(30px*var(--vh,1));font-weight:700;background:var(--paper);border:4px solid var(--ink);border-radius:10px;padding:0 .4em;white-space:nowrap}\n.hoverlabel{position:absolute;transform:translate(-50%,-120%);font-size:calc(36px*var(--vh,1));font-weight:700;background:#FFD23F;border:5px solid var(--ink);border-radius:14px;padding:.05em .55em;white-space:nowrap;box-shadow:0 5px 0 var(--ink)}\n.quad{position:absolute;inset:0}\n.breathring{position:absolute;bottom:5vh;left:calc(5.5vw + 25vh);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:.4vh}\n.podium{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:1vw;justify-content:center}\n.podium .p{width:min(18vw,300px);background:var(--wood);border:6px solid var(--ink);border-radius:14px 14px 0 0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;padding:.3em;font-size:calc(38px*var(--vh,1));text-align:center}\n.warn{background:#E8443A;color:#FFF8EE;border:6px solid var(--ink);border-radius:18px;padding:.2em .7em;font-size:calc(42px*var(--vh,1));font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 7px 0 var(--ink)}\n.devtext{font-size:calc(30px*var(--vh,1));background:var(--paper);border:5px solid var(--ink);border-radius:14px;padding:.4em;white-space:pre-wrap;width:80vw;line-height:1.1;overflow:hidden;max-height:60vh}\n.audioTag{position:fixed;top:1.5vh;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);background:#FFD23F;border:4px solid var(--ink);border-radius:12px;padding:.05em .6em;font-size:calc(30px*var(--vh,1));pointer-events:none}\nE\ncat > ui/focus.js <<'E'\n// Focus across menus: pad, keys and mouse all land on the same thing.\nexport class Focus {\n  constructor(input, audioHook) { this.input = input; this.layer = null; this.cur = null; this.hook = audioHook; }\n  setLayer(layer) { this.layer = layer; this.refresh(true); }\n  items() { return this.layer ? [...this.layer.el.querySelectorAll('[data-focus]')].filter(e => !e.classList.contains('nofocus')) : []; }\n  refresh(toFirst = false) {\n    const items = this.items();\n    if (!items.includes(this.cur) || toFirst) { const want = this.layer && this.layer.el.querySelector('[data-default]'); this.set(want || items[0] || null, true); } else if (this.cur) this.cur.classList.add('focused');\n  }\n  set(el, silent = false) {\n    if (this.cur === el) { if (el) el.classList.add('focused'); return; }\n    if (this.cur) this.cur.classList.remove('focused');\n    this.cur = el; if (el) { el.classList.add('focused'); if (!silent && this.hook) this.hook('move'); }\n  }\n  /** Move to the nearest item in a direction. */\n  move(dx, dy) {\n    const items = this.items(); if (!items.length) return false; if (!this.cur) { this.set(items[0]); return true; }\n    const a = this.cur.getBoundingClientRect(); const ax = a.left + a.width / 2, ay = a.top + a.height / 2; let best = null, bs = 1e12;\n    for (const it of items) {\n      if (it === this.cur) continue; const r = it.getBoundingClientRect(), x = r.left + r.width / 2, y = r.top + r.height / 2, ddx = x - ax, ddy = y - ay;\n      const along = ddx * dx + ddy * dy; if (along <= 4) continue;\n      const across = Math.abs(ddx * dy) + Math.abs(ddy * dx); const s = along + across * 2.2; if (s < bs) { bs = s; best = it; }\n    }\n    if (best) { this.set(best); return true; }\n    return false;\n  }\n  activate(el = this.cur) { if (el && el._act) { if (this.hook) this.hook('ok'); el._act(); } }\n  tick() {\n    const l = this.layer; if (!l) return;\n    const M = this.input.menu;\n    if (this.cur && !this.cur.isConnected) this.refresh(true);\n    if (M.up) this.move(0, -1); if (M.down) this.move(0, 1);\n    if (M.left) { if (this.cur && this.cur._adj) { this.cur._adj(-1); } else if (!this.move(-1, 0) && l.onLeft) l.onLeft(); }\n    if (M.right) { if (this.cur && this.cur._adj) { this.cur._adj(1); } else if (!this.move(1, 0) && l.onRight) l.onRight(); }\n    if (M.confirm) this.activate();\n    if (M.back && l.onBack) { if (this.hook) this.hook('back'); l.onBack(); }\n    if (M.more && l.onMore) l.onMore();\n  }\n}\nE\ncat > ui/ui.js <<'E'\n// DOM overlay: layered screens, tags, glyph prompts, toasts.\nimport { glyphHtml } from '../input/glyphs.js';\nimport { Focus } from './focus.js';\nexport const el = (tag, cls, html) => { const e = document.createElement(tag); if (cls) e.className = cls; if (html != null) e.innerHTML = html; return e; };\nexport const txt = (tag, cls, text) => { const e = document.createElement(tag); if (cls) e.className = cls; if (text != null) e.textContent = text; return e; };\nexport class UI {\n  constructor(input, audioHook) {\n    this.input = input; this.root = el('div'); this.root.id = 'screens'; this.hud = el('div'); this.hud.id = 'hud'; this.speech = el('div'); this.speech.id = 'speechRoot'; this.toastRoot = el('div'); this.toastRoot.id = 'toast';\n    document.body.append(this.hud, this.root, this.speech, this.toastRoot);\n    this.stack = []; this.focus = new Focus(input, audioHook); this.toasts = []; this.device = input.lastDevice;\n    // Hover moves the focus, but only when the pointer actually moved.\n    addEventListener('pointermove', (e) => {\n      if (e.pointerType === 'touch' || !this.input.hoverMoved) return; this.input.hoverMoved = false;\n      const t = document.elementFromPoint(e.clientX, e.clientY); const f = t && t.closest && t.closest('[data-focus]');\n      if (f && this.top() && this.top().el.contains(f)) this.focus.set(f);\n    });\n    addEventListener('click', (e) => { const t = e.target.closest && e.target.closest('[data-focus]'); if (t && this.top() && this.top().el.contains(t)) { this.focus.set(t, true); this.focus.activate(t); } else if (this.onWorldClick && (!this.top() || !this.top().el.contains(e.target))) this.onWorldClick(e); });\n    addEventListener('contextmenu', () => { const t = this.top(); if (t && t.onBack) { if (this.focus.hook) this.focus.hook('back'); t.onBack(); } });\n    this.setScale(1);\n    addEventListener('resize', () => this.setScale(this.scale));\n  }\n  setScale(s) { this.scale = s; document.documentElement.style.setProperty('--s', s); document.documentElement.style.setProperty('--vh', Math.min(innerHeight / 1080, innerWidth / 1920)); }\n  top() { return this.stack[this.stack.length - 1] || null; }\n  topId() { const t = this.top(); return t ? t.id : null; }\n  /** Open a layered screen. build(el, layer) fills it. */\n  open(id, build, opts = {}) {\n    const layer = { id, el: el('div', `screen ${opts.cls || ''}`), onBack: opts.onBack, onLeft: opts.onLeft, onRight: opts.onRight, onMore: opts.onMore, tick: opts.tick, rebuild: null };\n    layer.el.dataset.screen = id; layer.build = build;\n    layer.rebuild = (keepIndex = true) => {\n      const items0 = this.focus.items(); const idx = this.focus.cur ? items0.indexOf(this.focus.cur) : 0;\n      layer.el.innerHTML = ''; build(layer.el, layer); this.refreshGlyphs();\n      if (this.top() === layer) { const items = this.focus.items(); if (keepIndex && items.length) this.focus.set(items[Math.max(0, Math.min(idx, items.length - 1))], true); else this.focus.refresh(true); }\n    };\n    if (opts.replace && this.stack.length) this.close();\n    this.stack.push(layer); this.root.appendChild(layer.el); build(layer.el, layer); this.refreshGlyphs(); this.focus.setLayer(layer);\n    return layer;\n  }\n  close() { const l = this.stack.pop(); if (l) l.el.remove(); this.focus.cur = null; this.focus.setLayer(this.top()); }\n  closeAll() { while (this.stack.length) { this.stack.pop().el.remove(); } this.focus.cur = null; this.focus.setLayer(null); }\n  closeTo(id) { while (this.stack.length && this.topId() !== id) { this.stack.pop().el.remove(); } this.focus.cur = null; this.focus.setLayer(this.top()); }\n  has(id) { return this.stack.some(l => l.id === id); }\n  btn(label, act, opts = {}) { const b = el('div', `tag ${opts.cls || ''}`); if (opts.html) b.innerHTML = label; else b.textContent = label; b.dataset.focus = '1'; b._act = act; if (opts.def) b.dataset.default = '1'; return b; }\n  cardBtn(cls, act, build) { const b = el('div', cls); b.dataset.focus = '1'; b._act = act; build(b); return b; }\n  slider(label, get, set, min, max, step, fmt = (v) => v) {\n    const b = el('div', 'tag slider'); b.dataset.focus = '1'; const l = txt('span', '', label), bar = el('div', 'bar'), fill = el('div', 'fill'), val = txt('span', 'val', '');\n    bar.appendChild(fill); b.append(l, bar, val);\n    const draw = () => { const v = get(); fill.style.width = `${(v - min) / (max - min) * 100}%`; val.textContent = fmt(v); };\n    b._adj = (d) => { const n = Math.round((Math.max(min, Math.min(max, get() + d * step))) / step) * step; set(+n.toFixed(5)); draw(); };\n    b._act = () => b._adj(1);\n    const drag = (e) => { const r = bar.getBoundingClientRect(); const a = Math.max(0, Math.min(1, (e.clientX - r.left) / r.width)); const n = Math.round((min + a * (max - min)) / step) * step; set(+n.toFixed(5)); draw(); };\n    bar.addEventListener('pointerdown', (e) => { drag(e); e.stopPropagation(); bar.setPointerCapture?.(e.pointerId); });\n    bar.addEventListener('pointermove', (e) => { if (e.buttons & 1) drag(e); });\n    bar.addEventListener('click', (e) => e.stopPropagation());\n    draw(); return b;\n  }\n  toggle(label, get, set, on = 'On', off = 'Off') {\n    const b = el('div', 'tag slider'); b.dataset.focus = '1'; const l = txt('span', '', label), v = txt('span', 'val', ''); b.append(l, v);\n    const draw = () => { v.textContent = get() ? on : off; }; b._act = () => { set(!get()); draw(); }; b._adj = () => b._act(); draw(); return b;\n  }\n  choice(label, opts, get, set) {\n    const b = el('div', 'tag slider'); b.dataset.focus = '1'; const l = txt('span', '', label), v = txt('span', 'val', ''); b.append(l, v);\n    const draw = () => { const f = opts.find(o => o[0] === get()); v.textContent = f ? f[1] : ''; };\n    b._adj = (d) => { const i = opts.findIndex(o => o[0] === get()); set(opts[(i + d + opts.length) % opts.length][0]); draw(); }; b._act = () => b._adj(1); draw(); return b;\n  }\n  /** A prompt: verb glyph + words. Re-renders the same frame the device changes. */\n  promptEl(verb, words) { const p = el('span', 'prompt'); const g = el('span', 'pg'); g.dataset.verb = verb; p.append(g, txt('span', '', words)); return p; }\n  promptBar(list) { const bar = el('div', 'promptbar'); for (const [v, w] of list) bar.appendChild(this.promptEl(v, w)); return bar; }\n  bottom(list) { const b = el('div', 'bottomprompts'); b.appendChild(this.promptBar(list)); return b; }\n  refreshGlyphs(root = document) { const d = this.input.lastDevice; for (const n of root.querySelectorAll('[data-verb]')) n.innerHTML = glyphHtml(n.dataset.verb, d); }\n  toast(text, sec = 2.4) { const t = txt('div', 't', text); this.toastRoot.appendChild(t); this.toasts.push({ t, left: sec }); }\n  tick(dt) {\n    for (let i = this.toasts.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) { const o = this.toasts[i]; o.left -= dt; if (o.left <= 0) { o.t.remove(); this.toasts.splice(i, 1); } }\n    const t = this.top(); if (t && t.tick) t.tick(dt);\n    if (this.top()) this.focus.tick(dt);\n  }\n}\nE\ncat > ui/disc.js <<'E'\n// The Balance Disc: the game's signature HUD. Inline SVG, moved with transforms each frame.\nconst NS = 'http://www.w3.org/2000/svg';\nconst S = (t, a, p) => { const e = document.createElementNS(NS, t); for (const k in a) e.setAttribute(k, a[k]); if (p) p.appendChild(e); return e; };\nexport class Disc {\n  constructor(parent, sizeVh, name, colour) {\n    this.el = document.createElement('div'); this.el.className = 'disc';\n    const px = Math.round(innerHeight * sizeVh / 100); const R = 100;\n    const svg = S('svg', { viewBox: '-112 -112 224 224', width: px, height: px }); this.el.appendChild(svg);\n    S('circle', { r: R + 6, fill: '#FFF8EE', stroke: '#1A1420', 'stroke-width': 7 }, svg);\n    for (const r of [75, 50, 25]) S('circle', { r, fill: 'none', stroke: '#CDBFA8', 'stroke-width': 2.5 }, svg);\n    S('path', { d: 'M-100 0H100M0-100V100', stroke: '#CDBFA8', 'stroke-width': 2.5 }, svg);\n    this.zone = S('circle', { r: 30, fill: '#CDEBB8', stroke: '#2E8B57', 'stroke-width': 4, 'stroke-dasharray': '8 5', visibility: 'hidden' }, svg);\n    this.brace = S('circle', { r: 22, fill: '#9BE38A', stroke: '#1A1420', 'stroke-width': 3, visibility: 'hidden' }, svg);\n    this.trailG = S('polyline', { fill: 'none', stroke: '#1A1420', 'stroke-width': 3, 'stroke-opacity': .55, 'stroke-linejoin': 'round' }, svg);\n    this.ring = S('circle', { r: 15, fill: 'none', stroke: '#E8443A', 'stroke-width': 4.5 }, svg);\n    this.dot = S('circle', { r: 13, fill: colour || '#E8443A', stroke: '#1A1420', 'stroke-width': 4.5 }, svg);\n    if (name) { const n = document.createElement('div'); n.className = 'pname'; n.textContent = name; this.el.appendChild(n); }\n    // Trudy peeks over the rim.\n    const t = S('g', { transform: 'translate(0,-112)' }, svg); this.trudy = t;\n    S('rect', { x: -36, y: -18, width: 72, height: 28, rx: 8, fill: '#F5B700', stroke: '#1A1420', 'stroke-width': 4 }, t);\n    S('rect', { x: -21, y: -11, width: 42, height: 14, rx: 7, fill: '#B9F26B', stroke: '#1A1420', 'stroke-width': 3 }, t);\n    this.bubble = S('circle', { r: 5.5, cy: -4, fill: '#fff', stroke: '#1A1420', 'stroke-width': 2.5 }, t);\n    parent.appendChild(this.el); this.trail = []; this.tT = 0;\n  }\n  update(dt, cobX, cobZ, wishX, wishZ, zone, brace) {\n    const R = 100, cx = Math.max(-1.1, Math.min(1.1, cobX)) * R, cz = Math.max(-1.1, Math.min(1.1, cobZ)) * R;\n    this.dot.setAttribute('transform', `translate(${cx.toFixed(1)},${cz.toFixed(1)})`);\n    this.ring.setAttribute('transform', `translate(${(wishX * R).toFixed(1)},${(wishZ * R).toFixed(1)})`);\n    this.tT += dt; if (this.tT > .03) { this.tT = 0; this.trail.push(`${cx.toFixed(0)},${cz.toFixed(0)}`); if (this.trail.length > 16) this.trail.shift(); this.trailG.setAttribute('points', this.trail.join(' ')); }\n    if (zone) {\n      this.zone.setAttribute('visibility', 'visible'); this.zone.setAttribute('r', (zone.r * R).toFixed(1)); this.zone.setAttribute('cx', (zone.x * R).toFixed(1)); this.zone.setAttribute('cy', (zone.z * R).toFixed(1));\n      const inz = Math.hypot(cobX - zone.x, cobZ - zone.z) <= zone.r; this.zone.setAttribute('fill', inz ? '#8FE07A' : '#F1E3CC');\n    } else this.zone.setAttribute('visibility', 'hidden');\n    if (brace) { this.brace.setAttribute('visibility', 'visible'); this.brace.setAttribute('cx', (brace.x * R).toFixed(1)); this.brace.setAttribute('cy', (brace.z * R).toFixed(1)); } else this.brace.setAttribute('visibility', 'hidden');\n    this.bubble.setAttribute('cx', (Math.max(-1, Math.min(1, -cobX)) * 14).toFixed(1));\n  }\n  remove() { this.el.remove(); }\n}\nE\ncat > ui/speech.js <<'E'\n// A paper speech tag in the lower third, text typing out in time with the voice. Everything spoken is on screen.\nimport { el, txt } from './ui.js';\nexport const SPEAKERS = { trudy: { name: 'Trudy', rate: 16 }, stillwater: { name: 'Ms. Stillwater', rate: 7 }, bolster: { name: 'Coach Bolster', rate: 11 }, margaret: { name: 'Gentle Margaret', rate: 12 }, kevin: { name: 'Retired Kevin', rate: 12 }, sandra: { name: 'Both Sandras', rate: 12 }, paul: { name: 'Unsteady Paul', rate: 12 }, gerald: { name: 'Young Gerald', rate: 12 } };\nexport class Speech {\n  constructor(ui, input, audio) { this.ui = ui; this.input = input; this.audio = audio; this.cur = null; this.queue = []; this.barkT = 0; this.lastText = ''; this.spoken = 0; }\n  get busy() { return !!this.cur && !this.cur.bark; }\n  /** Blocking line: Use advances. Returns the line record; `done` turns true. */\n  say(who, text) { const r = { who, text, bark: false, done: false }; this.queue.push(r); if (!this.cur) this.next(); return r; }\n  bark(who, text, sec = 3.2) { if (this.cur && !this.cur.bark) return null; const r = { who, text, bark: true, sec, done: false }; if (this.cur) this.finish(); this.cur = null; this.show(r); return r; }\n  next() { const r = this.queue.shift(); if (r) this.show(r); }\n  show(r) {\n    this.clearDom(); this.cur = r; this.spoken++; this.lastText = r.text;\n    const sp = SPEAKERS[r.who] || { name: r.who, rate: 12 };\n    const box = el('div', `speech ${r.bark ? 'bark' : ''}`); box.appendChild(txt('div', 'who', sp.name));\n    r.tEl = txt('div', 'text', ''); box.appendChild(r.tEl);\n    if (!r.bark) { const n = el('div', 'next'); const g = el('span'); g.dataset.verb = 'use'; n.appendChild(g); box.appendChild(n); box.addEventListener('click', (e) => { e.stopPropagation(); this.advance(); }); }\n    this.ui.speech.appendChild(box); this.ui.refreshGlyphs(box); this.box = box;\n    r.shown = 0; r.t = 0; r.age = 0; r.rate = sp.rate * 1.6;\n    if (this.audio) this.audio.speak(r.who, r.text);\n  }\n  advance() {\n    const r = this.cur; if (!r) return;\n    if (r.shown < r.text.length) { r.shown = r.text.length; r.tEl.textContent = r.text; return; }\n    this.finish();\n  }\n  finish() { const r = this.cur; if (r) r.done = true; this.clearDom(); this.cur = null; if (this.queue.length) this.next(); }\n  clearDom() { if (this.box) { this.box.remove(); this.box = null; } }\n  clear() { this.queue.length = 0; if (this.cur) this.cur.done = true; this.cur = null; this.clearDom(); if (this.audio) this.audio.hushVoice?.(); }\n  tick(dt, menuTop) {\n    const r = this.cur; if (!r) return;\n    r.age += dt;\n    if (r.shown < r.text.length) { r.t += dt * r.rate; const n = Math.min(r.text.length, Math.floor(r.t)); if (n !== r.shown) { r.shown = n; r.tEl.textContent = r.text.slice(0, n); } }\n    if (r.bark) { if (r.age > r.sec + r.text.length / r.rate) this.finish(); return; }\n    if (!menuTop && (this.input.merged.use || this.input.merged.hop) && r.age > .1) this.advance();\n  }\n}\nE\necho ok","description":"Write UI CSS, screen framework, focus, disc and speech"}}}
