{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgjnz6SFrtcGbe6sCD287","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_011xfUwzy6ougRhmb1P8xtzn","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat >> notes/issues.md <<'E'\n4. Room Service: tumblers spawned overlapping the doll's own capsule and were kicked off the tray. Caught by balance test (T1 delivered 2 of 5). CRITICAL\n5. Bots: delayed correction resonated with its own noise frequency (average bot in Still Water wandered, 25 form). Caught by balance test. Bot bug, not a game bug.\n6. Fruit Hat: urchins stayed in the hat as dead weight and took 2 points each, sharp bot lost most of its score. Caught by balance test.\n7. Plates: bot flipped between plates and sharp scored below clumsy; bot now commits to a plate. Caught by balance test.\n8. Grand Hold: gain 1.4 oscillates on the stiffer body, sharp bot was in the ring 30% of the time. Caught by events sweep.\n9. Forced/pending gusts survived a fall and knocked the doll over again on recovery. Caught by events soak. \nE\npython3 -I - <<'E'\ns=open('src/input/bot.js').read()\ns=s.replace(\"n * Math.sin(this.t * 3.1 + 1.3)\",\"n * Math.sin(this.t * 1.13 + 1.3)\").replace(\"n * Math.sin(this.t * 2.7 + .4)\",\"n * Math.sin(this.t * 1.41 + .4)\")\nopen('src/input/bot.js','w').write(s)\ns=open('src/events/grandHold.js').read()\ns=s.replace(\"const load = this.phaseI === 1; const [x, y] = br.correct(dt, l, gx, gz, load);\",\"const [x, y] = br.correct(dt, l, gx, gz, true);\")\nopen('src/events/grandHold.js','w').write(s)\ns=open('src/events/fruitHat.js').read()\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"let gx = 0, gz = 0; if (best && best.kind !== 'urchin') { gx = (best.lx - l.x) / .46; gz = (best.lz - l.z) / .46; const m = Math.hypot(gx, gz); if (m > 1) { gx /= m; gz /= m; } }\"\"\",\"\"\"let gx = 0, gz = 0;\n    if (best) { const dx = best.lx - l.x, dz = best.lz - l.z, d = Math.hypot(dx, dz) || .001;\n      if (best.kind === 'urchin') { gx = -dx / d * .75; gz = -dz / d * .75; } // dodge\n      else { const need = Math.max(0, d - .2) / .46; gx = dx / d * need; gz = dz / d * need; } }\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"f.landed = true; f.inHat = true; l.hatFruit.push(f); if (f.ring) { this.group.remove(f.ring); f.ring = null; }\"\"\",\"\"\"f.landed = true; f.inHat = f.kind !== 'urchin'; if (f.inHat) l.hatFruit.push(f); if (f.ring) { this.group.remove(f.ring); f.ring = null; }\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"if (f.kind === 'urchin') { l.bankScore = Math.max(0, l.bankScore - 2); this.gust(l, (this.r() - .5) * 1.4, (this.r() - .5) * 1.4, .25);\"\"\",\"\"\"if (f.kind === 'urchin') { l.bankScore = Math.max(0, l.bankScore - 1); f.body.setLinvel({ x: (this.r() - .5) * 5, y: 3, z: (this.r() - .5) * 5 }, true); this.gust(l, (this.r() - .5) * 1.4, (this.r() - .5) * 1.4, .25);\"\"\")\nopen('src/events/fruitHat.js','w').write(s)\nE\nnode tools/build.mjs | tail -1; V=1 timeout 550 node tools/test.mjs balance 2>&1 | cut -c1-200 | grep -v '^ *at ' | grep -E 'FAIL|passed|fruit|room|still|plates|spring|^\\{' ","description":"Apply bot and Fruit Hat fixes and rerun the balance test","timeout":570000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7575,"cache_read_input_tokens":399429,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7575},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4c3cb271-fa3a-4db7-9b9c-5b70edc7a0c6","uuid":"722a925c-c0ae-4bc9-b262-d6735ee0ed9b","timestamp":"2026-11-05T12:38:27.650Z","request_id":"req_011Cgjnz64SZk32kPrNwzY4v","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_011xfUwzy6ougRhmb1P8xtzn":{"command":"cat >> notes/issues.md <<'E'\n4. Room Service: tumblers spawned overlapping the doll's own capsule and were kicked off the tray. Caught by balance te