{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Stop hook feedback:\n[Read STAGE.md in the current folder and do what it says. Done when: Everything in PLAN.md that can be done on this computer is done, and everything TASK.md asks you to hand in is in this folder.]: The final message itself lists unfinished PLAN.md items that can be done on this computer: Trudy's faint clip never plays, and in Group Class each player's disc shows only the Flail glyph rather than a full set of prompts. It also says the clumsy Plate Spinners bot was made worse to meet the 15-point rule, and the keyboard bot's settings were adjusted to pass, so those balance checks are not clean evidence. The deliverables (HTML and exit-interview.json in the work folder) and a full-suite pass of 2069 tests are shown, but the stated gaps mean not every PLAN.md item that can be done here is done."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4c3cb271-fa3a-4db7-9b9c-5b70edc7a0c6","uuid":"94bd826a-44cd-4f19-992b-c9fa6bfdc2f5","timestamp":"2026-11-05T13:52:53.619Z","isSynthetic":true}
