{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjunGjcNRCeffTau7wDm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Two parts of that are actionable, so I'll deal with both:\n\n1. **No-breath numbers:** my drift also hit players who weren't breathing, which is what pushed those figures away from the plan's, and parking without breath never needed fixing (it scored 80 before the drift). If the drift only applies while breathing in sync, the no-breath play should go back to the plan's numbers.\n2. **Art pass:** section 17 lists the exact scenes to review by eye at 1920×1080. I reviewed batches during the build but never did the full list on a final file, so I'll do that now."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1207,"cache_read_input_tokens":601773,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1207},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4c3cb271-fa3a-4db7-9b9c-5b70edc7a0c6","uuid":"18996753-d6a0-4679-aaac-a20b1d769f69","timestamp":"2026-11-05T14:07:07.796Z","request_id":"req_011CgjunGPmuZw1upqAVvvhx"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjunGjcNRCeffTau7wDm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0184J9vkyWpPwAtivGmKpUDn","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 -I - <<'E'\ndef sub(path, old, new):\n    s=open(path).read(); assert old in s, (path, old[:60]); open(path,'w').write(s.replace(old,new))\nsub('src/events/poses.js',\"\"\"  /** A slow lean you must keep correcting by hand: a parked stick drifts out of the ring, even breathing well. */\"\"\",\"\"\"  /** Breathing in time steadies you, but your breath is a small tide: a slow lean that a parked stick can't follow. */\"\"\")\nsub('src/events/poses.js',\"m = this.tier.drift * a * (l.breathSync ? .6 : 1) * this.diff.dist * T.swayScale;\",\"m = this.tier.drift * a * (l.breathSync ? .6 : 0) * this.diff.dist * T.swayScale;\")\nE\nnode tools/build.mjs | tail -1; node tools/dbg.mjs '\nconst out={}; const P=__TEST__.EVENTS.poses; const orig=P.prototype.botInput; const park=function(i,t,sk,dt){const l=this.lanes[i]; return {x:l.zone.x,z:l.zone.z,breath:(this.t%8)<4};};\nfor(const t of [0,1,2]){ const r={}; for(const s of [\"sharp\",\"average\",\"clumsy\"]){ let v=[],w=[]; for(let sd=1;sd<=3;sd++){ __TEST__.seed(sd*37); v.push(__TEST__.runEvent(\"poses\",{tier:t,skills:[s]}).res[0].form); __TEST__.seed(sd*37); w.push(__TEST__.runEvent(\"poses\",{tier:t,skills:[s],opts:{botMode:\"nobreath\"}}).res[0].form);} r[s]=[Math.round(v.reduce((a,b)=>a+b)/3),Math.round(w.reduce((a,b)=>a+b)/3)];} P.prototype.botInput=park; let v=[]; for(let sd=1;sd<=4;sd++){__TEST__.seed(sd*53); v.push(Math.round(__TEST__.runEvent(\"poses\",{tier:t,skills:[\"sharp\"]}).res[0].form));} r.parkBreath=v; P.prototype.botInput=orig; let u=[]; for(let sd=1;sd<=4;sd++){__TEST__.seed(sd*53); u.push(Math.round(__TEST__.runEvent(\"poses\",{tier:t,skills:[\"sharp\"],opts:{botMode:\"park\"}}).res[0].form));} r.parkNo=u; out[\"T\"+(t+1)]=r; } return out;'\npython3 -I - <<'E'\ns=open('tools/shots.mjs').read()\n# Day 1 island at full tilt, Day 5 nearly level, wide; group class of four through local lanes\ns=s.replace(\"g.profile.marbleList = new Array(40).fill('#F5B700'); g.profile.marbles = 40; g.startHub(); });\",\"g.profile.marbleList = new Array(40).fill('#F5B700'); g.profile.marbles = 40; g.startHub(); g.hub.camDist = 22; g.hub.camPitch = .6; });\")\ns=s.replace(\"group4: async () => ev('fruitHat', 12, ['sharp', 'average', 'clumsy', 'average']),\",\"group4: async () => { await p.evaluate(() => { const g = __TEST__.g; g.ui.closeAll(); g.scripts.clear(); g.clearMode(); for (const q of [0, 1, 2, 3]) { window.__p = 1; } const pads = g.input.pads, specs = [{ kind: 'local', ctrl: pads[0], name: 'Seat 1', colour: '#E8443A' }, { kind: 'local', ctrl: g.input.kbm, name: 'Seat 2', colour: '#3B82F6' }, { kind: 'local', ctrl: pads[1], name: 'Seat 3', colour: '#22C55E' }, { kind: 'local', ctrl: pads[2], name: 'Seat 4', colour: '#F5B700' }]; const e = g.startEventMode(__TEST__.EVENTS.fruitHat, { tier: 0 }, specs); e.count = .01; g.ui.refreshGlyphs(); }); await p.evaluate(() => __TEST__.advance(9)); },\")\nopen('tools/shots.mjs','w').write(s)\nE\nnode tools/shots.mjs 2>&1 | grep -vE ' webgpu alive ' | cut -c1-200 | head; cd notes/shots; for n in 1:\"title menu island island5 jar arrival\" 2:\"poses cairn stillWater logReps plank tug\" 3:\"stepClass plates islandLoop fruitHat roomService springboard\" 4:\"raft grandHold checkin group4 results agereveal\" 5:\"question plan journal pause dev about\"; do i=${n%%:*}; magick montage ${n#*:} -tile 3x2 -geometry 640x360+2+2 art$i.png 2>/dev/null || true; done; true; for n in 1:\"title menu island island5 jar arrival\" 2:\"poses cairn stillWater logReps plank tug\" 3:\"stepClass plates islandLoop fruitHat roomService springboard\" 4:\"raft grandHold checkin group4 results agereveal\" 5:\"question plan journal pause dev about\"; do i=${n%%:*}; f=\"\"; for x in ${n#*:}; do f=\"$f $x.png\"; done; magick montage $f -tile 3