{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjvSbWXTYJ8Vc4vwSPtA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All three can be worked on here, so I won't leave them as judgement calls:\n- **About pages:** larger type, splitting long answers across more pages, which the plan explicitly allows.\n- **Backdrop island:** give it a rocky base so it stops reading as a ship.\n- **Bot gap:** this may come from my own change. I moved the bots' noise frequency to stop a resonance, and the plan doesn't state a value. I'll sweep the frequency against all the plan's stated figures and see whether one value reproduces them."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1404,"cache_read_input_tokens":623027,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1404},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4c3cb271-fa3a-4db7-9b9c-5b70edc7a0c6","uuid":"5a4579ed-eb46-434d-a769-c36cdc97092b","timestamp":"2026-11-05T14:15:51.580Z","request_id":"req_011CgjvSbBBn5BHXAMmod8ph"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjvSbWXTYJ8Vc4vwSPtA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01BiVwMYzpAeeg7PbGy7X9Ta","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 -I - <<'E'\ndef sub(path, old, new):\n    s=open(path).read(); assert old in s, (path, old[:60]); open(path,'w').write(s.replace(old,new))\nsub('src/input/bot.js',\"n * Math.sin(this.t * 1.13 + 1.3)\",\"n * Math.sin(this.t * Brain.noiseX + 1.3)\")\nsub('src/input/bot.js',\"n * Math.sin(this.t * 1.41 + .4)\",\"n * Math.sin(this.t * Brain.noiseZ + .4)\")\ns=open('src/input/bot.js').read(); s=s.rstrip()+\"\\nBrain.noiseX = 1.13; Brain.noiseZ = 1.41;\\n\"; open('src/input/bot.js','w').write(s)\nsub('src/core/testhooks.js',\"import { Session } from '../game/session.js';\",\"import { Session } from '../game/session.js';\\nimport { Brain, SKILLS } from '../input/bot.js';\")\nsub('src/core/testhooks.js',\"g, T, EVENTS, DAYS, Menus, Session,\",\"g, T, EVENTS, DAYS, Menus, Session, Brain, SKILLS,\")\n# About: larger type, more pages\nsub('src/game/ending.js',\"function paged(title, rows, maxChars = 900)\",\"function paged(title, rows, maxChars = 560)\")\nsub('src/ui/ui.css',\"text-align:left;font-size:calc(30px*var(--vh,1));line-height:1.16;\",\"text-align:left;font-size:calc(38px*var(--vh,1));line-height:1.2;\")\n# backdrop rock\ns=open('src/art/island.js').read()\na=\"this.skirt = cyl(16, 25, 12, '#8F8578', 32); this.pivot.add(at(this.skirt, 0, -9, 0));\"\nassert a in s\ns=s.replace(a,a+\" for (let i = 0; i < 26; i++) { const an = i / 26 * 6.283, r = 21 + (i % 3) * 1.6; const b = sphere(3 + (i * 7 % 4) * .9, ['#8F8578', '#A69A8C', '#7A7268', '#6FA05A'][i % 4], 1.2, .8, 1); b.position.set(Math.cos(an) * r, -2.4 - (i % 3) * .8, Math.sin(an) * r); b.rotation.y = i; this.pivot.add(b); }\")\nopen('src/art/island.js','w').write(s)\nE\nnode tools/build.mjs | tail -1; node tools/dbg.mjs '\nconst B=__TEST__.Brain, out={}; const avg=(id,s,o,t)=>{let v=[];for(let d=1;d<=3;d++){__TEST__.seed(d*37);v.push(__TEST__.runEvent(id,{tier:t||0,skills:[s],opts:o||{}}).res[0].form);}return Math.round(v.reduce((a,b)=>a+b)/3);};\nfor(const [x,z] of [[1.13,1.41],[1.6,1.9],[2,2.3],[2.4,2.1],[2.7,3.1],[3.1,2.7]]){B.noiseX=x;B.noiseZ=z;const r={};for(const s of [\"sharp\",\"average\",\"clumsy\"]) r[s]=[avg(\"poses\",s,{botMode:\"nobreath\"}),avg(\"poses\",s),avg(\"stillWater\",s),avg(\"logReps\",s),avg(\"cairn\",s,{},1)];out[x+\"/\"+z]=r;} return out;'; echo 'plan: poses nobreath 95/66/54; breath 100/91/78; stillWater 100/89/48; logReps 97/77/50; (cols: poses-nobreath, poses-breath, stillWater, logReps, cairnT2)'","description":"Sweep bot noise frequency against the plan's figures; About type; island rocks","timeout":300000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1404,"cache_read_input_tokens":623027,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1404},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4c3cb271-fa3a-4db7-9b9c-5b70edc7a0c6","uuid":"6f32f421-641c-433c-8070-60d8e7265fdd","timestamp":"2026-11-05T14:16:02.616Z","request_id":"req_011CgjvSbBBn5BHXAMmod8ph","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01BiVwMYzpAeeg7PbGy7X9Ta":{"command":"python3 -I - <<'E'\ndef sub(path, old, new):\n    s=open(path).read(); assert old in s, (path, old[:60]); open(path,'w').write(s.replace(old,new))\nsub('src/input/bot.js',\"n * Math.sin(this.t * 1.13 + 1.3)\",\"n * Math.sin(this.t * Brain.noiseX + 1.3)\")\nsub('src/input/bot.js',\"n * Math.sin(this.t * 1.41 + .4)\",\"n * Math.sin(this.t * Brain.noiseZ + .4)\")\ns=open('src/input/bot.js').read(); s=s.rstrip()+\"\\nBrain.noiseX = 1.13; Brain.noiseZ = 1.41;\\n\"; open('src/input/bot.js','w').write(s)\nsub('s