{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjvaLqCLyEL3CgCk6o6P","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The 1.8/2.0 setting brings the clumsy bot closer to plan at each stable value, though the average bot stays high. I'll adopt it, then run the balance tests and check the new About pages and backdrop.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1073,"cache_read_input_tokens":627243,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1073},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4c3cb271-fa3a-4db7-9b9c-5b70edc7a0c6","uuid":"f0e1cda6-7654-409c-ab46-e97ca3a2e7d2","timestamp":"2026-11-05T14:17:29.442Z","request_id":"req_011CgjvaLS94SPDihosqXbup","narration_block_indexes":[0],"thinking_duration_ms":1,"thinking_display":"updates"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjvaLqCLyEL3CgCk6o6P","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Vv6jKYZJYCyEfqEAxjQLRh","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"sed -i 's/^Brain.noiseX = 1.13; Brain.noiseZ = 1.41;/Brain.noiseX = 1.8; Brain.noiseZ = 2; \\/\\/ The plan does not state these. Scores are sensitive to them: see notes\\/art-pass.md./' src/input/bot.js\npython3 -I - <<'E'\ns=open('notes/art-pass.md').read()\ns=s.replace(\"Left as they are, a judgement call: the distant backdrop island reads a little like a ship; the About pages have spare room below the text.\",\"Then fixed: the backdrop island read like a ship, so it has a rocky base; About pages use larger type and split long answers across more pages.\")\ns+=\"\"\"\n# Bots against the plan's figures\nThe plan's model is wish = goal + gain x (goal - dot) + noise x sin(...), and it does not state the frequency in sin(...). The bots run close to the edge of stability, so scores swing with it. Poses T1 without breath, average/clumsy: 1.13 rad/s gives 97/85, 1.8 gives 96/77, 2.2 gives 86/20, 2.7 gives 70/74. No value reproduces all the plan's figures. Kept 1.8/2.0, the closest stable fit. Section 17's stated thresholds are what the balance test enforces.\n\"\"\"\nopen('notes/art-pass.md','w').write(s)\nE\nnode tools/build.mjs | tail -1; V=1 timeout 200 node tools/test.mjs balance 2>&1 | grep -E '^FAIL|passed|crashed|form' | cut -c1-120; node tools/shots.mjs prep fruitHat about 2>&1 | grep -vE 'webgpu alive' | head -3; node tools/dbg.mjs 'return __TEST__.about().length'; cd notes/shots; magick montage fruitHat.png about.png -tile 2x1 -geometry 800x450+2+2 s7.png 2>/dev/null; cd ../..","description":"Adopt closest bot fit, run balance, render About and backdrop","timeout":400000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1073,"cache_read_input_tokens":627243,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1073},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4c3cb271-fa3a-4db7-9b9c-5b70edc7a0c6","uuid":"655ba920-a512-47b8-979e-3b22fd2d4be1","timestamp":"2026-11-05T14:17:34.676Z","request_id":"req_011CgjvaLS94SPDihosqXbup","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01Vv6jKYZJYCyEfqEAxjQLRh":{"command":"sed -i 's/^Brain.noiseX = 1.13; Brain.noiseZ = 1.41;/Brain.noiseX = 1.8; Brain.noiseZ = 2; \\/\\/ The plan does not state these. Scores are sensitive to them: see notes\\/art-pass.md./' src/input/bot.js\npython3 -I - <<'E'\ns=open('notes/art-pass.md').read()\ns=s.replace(\"Left as they are, a judgement call: the distant backdrop island reads a little like a ship; the About pages have spare room below the text.\",\"Then fixed: the backdrop island read like a ship, so it has a rocky base; About pages use larger type and split long answers across more pages.\")\ns+=\"\"\"\n# Bots against the plan's figures\nThe plan's model is wish = goal + gain x (goal - dot) + noise x sin(...), and it does not state the frequency in sin(...). The bots run close to the edge of stability, so scores swing with it. Poses T1 without breath, average/clumsy: 1.13 rad/s gives 97/85, 1.8 gives 96/77, 2.2 gives 86/20, 2.7 gives 70/74. No value reproduces all the plan's figures. Kept 1.8/2.0, the closest stable fit. Section 17's stated thresholds are what the balance test enforces.\n\"\"\"\nopen('notes/art-pass.md','w').write(s)\nE\nnode tools/build.mjs | tail -1; V=1 timeout 200 node tools/test.mjs balance 2>&1 | grep -E '^FAIL|passed|crashed|form' | cut -c1-120; node tools/shots.mjs prep fruitHat about 2>&1 | grep -vE 'webgpu alive' | head -3; node tools/dbg.mjs 'return __TEST__.about().length'; cd notes/shots; magick montage fruitHat.png about.png -tile 2x1 -geometry 800x450+2+2 s7.png 2>/dev/null; cd ../..","description":"Adopt closest bot fit, run balance, render About and backdrop","timeout":400000}}}
