{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjwF4UHnwVY5XfgWXR5c","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All 13 About pages check out, though \"catch?:\" has a stray colon. The Tug measurement shows a real fault from my own change: at full stick there are no falls, and the average bot loses where the plan has it winning 88%, partly because late timing errors stop bots from pressing. I'll fix the bot and re-measure, starting from the plan's .72.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5879,"cache_read_input_tokens":633479,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5879},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4c3cb271-fa3a-4db7-9b9c-5b70edc7a0c6","uuid":"73f33d50-cfa4-483e-af56-34ef8107257b","timestamp":"2026-11-05T14:26:35.380Z","request_id":"req_011CgjwF41WDmwtagcLe6T6d","narration_block_indexes":[0],"thinking_duration_ms":3,"thinking_display":"updates"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjwF4UHnwVY5XfgWXR5c","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01UgEaV2daP9CjwPa46wChic","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat >> notes/issues.md <<'E'\n31. CRITICAL Tug of Peace: leaning too far carried no risk (no falls at full stick), so the event's one decision was gone. My retune of the over-lean threshold had hidden a bot bug. Caught by measuring outcomes against the plan's table.\n32. Tug bot never pressed when its timing error came out late, skipping about half the calls. Caught by the same measurement.\nE\npython3 -I - <<'E'\ndef sub(path, old, new):\n    s=open(path).read(); assert old in s, (path, old[:60]); open(path,'w').write(s.replace(old,new))\nsub('src/data/tuning.js',\"  rhythmWindow: {\",\"  tugOverlean:  { group: 'Events', label: 'Tug over-lean share', min: .4, max: 1, step: .01, default: .72 },\\n  rhythmWindow: {\")\ns=open('src/events/tug.js').read()\na=\"l.bal.leanZ / l.bal.maxLeanRad() > .88\"; assert a in s; s=s.replace(a,\"l.bal.leanZ / l.bal.maxLeanRad() > T.tugOverlean\")\ns=s.replace(\"import { EventBase } from './base.js';\",\"import { EventBase } from './base.js';\\nimport { T } from '../core/tuning.js';\") if \"core/tuning\" not in s else s\na=\"this.callT = CALL; this.lastCall = this.playT;\"; assert a in s; s=s.replace(a,\"this.callT = CALL; this.lastCall = this.playT; this.callN = (this.callN || 0) + 1;\")\ni=s.index(\"    if (l.nextErr === undefined || l.lastCallSeen\"); j=s.index(\"  laneResult(i) {\",i)\ns=s[:i]+\"\"\"    // Press at the call plus this skill's timing error, early or late.\n    const nextCall = (this.callN || 0) + 1;\n    if (l.fireAt == null && l.doneCall !== nextCall && this.pullBreak <= 0) { l.fireAt = this.callAt + br.gauss() * br.s.timing; l.aimCall = nextCall; }\n    if (l.fireAt != null && this.playT >= l.fireAt) { l.fireAt = null; l.doneCall = l.aimCall; l.pressHold = .06; }\n    const held = (l.pressHold || 0) > 0; if (held) l.pressHold -= dt;\n    return { x, z, lf: held ? 1 : 0, rf: held ? 1 : 0, flail: this.opts.botFlail ? (l.bal?.angle || 0) > .56 : false };\n  }\n\"\"\"+s[j:]\nopen('src/events/tug.js','w').write(s)\nsub('src/ui/screens/menus.js',\"if (k) { d.appendChild(txt('b', '', `${k}: `)); }\",\"if (k) { d.appendChild(txt('b', '', /[?)]$/.test(k) ? `${k} ` : `${k}: `)); }\")\nE\ngrep -n \"callAt\" src/events/tug.js | head -3 | cut -c1-120\nnode tools/build.mjs | tail -1; cat > /dev/null <<'E'\nE\nnode tools/dbg.mjs '\nconst out={}; const E=__TEST__.EVENTS.tug.prototype, orig=E.botInput;\nconst run=(t,s,stick)=>{ E.botInput=function(i,tt,sk,dt){ const r=orig.call(this,i,tt,sk,dt); const l=this.lanes[i]; const [x,z]=l.brain.correct(dt,l,0,stick,false,.5); return {...r,x,z}; }; let w=0,f=0,time=0; const n=4; for(let d=1;d<=n;d++){ __TEST__.seed(d*29); const R=__TEST__.runEvent(\"tug\",{tier:t,skills:[s]}); const p=R.res[0].big.split(\"-\").map(Number); if(p[0]>p[1])w++; f+=R.res[0].falls; time+=R.playT; } E.botInput=orig; return w+\"/\"+n+\" f\"+(f/n).toFixed(1)+\" \"+Math.round(time/n)+\"s\"; };\nfor(const th of [.72,.78,.84]){ __TEST__.T.tugOverlean=th; const o={}; for(const [t,st] of [[0,.9],[1,.85],[1,1],[2,.85],[2,.95],[2,1]]) o[\"T\"+(t+1)+\"@\"+st]=[\"sharp\",\"average\",\"clumsy\"].map(s=>run(t,s,st)).join(\" | \"); out[th]=o; } return out;' | python3 -I -c \"import json,sys;d=json.load(sys.stdin);[print(k,*[f'\\n  {a}: {b}' for a,b in v.items()]) for k,v in d.items()]\"; echo 'plan: T1@.9 all win 25-48s; T2@.85 100/88/0; T2@1 wins, 3-4 falls; T3@.85 sharp only; T3@.95 100/88/0; T3@1 6-7 falls, sharp only'","description":"Fix the Tug bot, restore the plan's threshold, measure outcomes","timeout":300000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5879,"cache_read_input_tokens":633479,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens