{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjwsNuZjLFaq91S9LsJ8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"`node tools/test.mjs full` passes on the final file: **2200 passed, 0 failed** (the HTML's hash starts `75a0bb40`), and it still makes no external requests. Your last check turned up a real problem that I had caused, and that's now fixed. Some of the plan's exact figures still don't match, and I'm not going to force them to; details are below.\n\n## The real bug: Tug of Peace\nComparing Tug's outcomes with the plan's table showed that leaning too far carried no risk, which removed the event's one decision. The cause was mine: I'd raised the plan's over-lean threshold from .72 to .88 to cover what was really a bot bug, where a late press never fired. With the bot fixed, the plan's own **.72 works**, so I restored it and corrected the exit file's answer that had blamed the plan.\n\nThat adds two issues, for a total of **32, with 10 critical**:\n- **Testing Feedback 1:** 32 real issues, logged one line each in notes/issues.md as they happened.\n- **Testing Feedback 2:** now opens \"10:\" and adds \"Tug of Peace losing its one decision, because a retune of mine had hidden a bot bug.\"\n- **Prompt Feedback 2:** The plan's bot model doesn't state its noise frequency, and bot scores swing widely with it, so its skill figures can't be reproduced exactly; I chose the closest stable value. Also SOURCE in the file name: I wrote it as WiiFit without the space, since the task doesn't say.\n\n## Your other points\n- **About pages:** I reviewed all 13 by eye at the final pagination. Nothing is clipped, and I fixed a stray colon after the questions.\n- **Plate Spinners:** the 65% bands land close to the plan's measured behaviour, and a new test now holds each figure within 10 points:\n\n| Share alive: sharp / average / clumsy | This build | Plan |\n|---|---|---|\n| Gentle | 100 / 93 / 80 | 100 / 89 / 82 |\n| Honest | 98 / 88 / 75 | 89 / 86 / 74 |\n| Unreasonable | 86 / 80 / 68 | 79 / 76 / 66 |\n\n## Where the numbers still differ from the plan\n- **Poses bots:** average without breath is still 96 against the plan's 66. I won't give each bot its own noise value to hit that figure, because a match made that way would prove nothing. The plan doesn't state the value, its figures depend on it, and its own guard (parked play at 75–81) does match.\n- **Tug of Peace:**\n  - At .85 everyone wins on the upper tiers, where the plan has the top tier winnable by the sharp bot only.\n  - Full stick costs more falls than the plan measured: about 9–16 a class on Honest (plan 3–4) and 6–9 on Unreasonable (plan 6–7).\n  - At .95 on Unreasonable the bots keep falling and lose, where the plan has them mostly winning.\n  - The decision is back, but greed is punished harder than planned.\n- **Deliberate additions after measuring:**\n  - the 65% bands\n  - the slow lean in Poses while breathing in sync\n\nThe plan tells the builder to tune and to \"measure before you trust a number\", and section 17's balance thresholds all pass. `notes/art-pass.md` records these numbers.\n\n## What can't be checked here\nOnly a real controller, TV and phone, and a person listening and playing, remain unchecked. TASK.md says those are \"never required\". So whether the game is fun and whether the music is good are still unjudged.\n\nEverything TASK.md asks for is in `work/`, and nothing is committed:\n- `TotterFit-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261105-045333.html`\n- `exit-interview.json`\n- `TotterFit-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261105-045333/` (dev folder)"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":649,"cache_read_input_tokens":649935,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":649},"output_tokens":772,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4c3cb271-fa3a-4db7-9b9c-5b70edc7a0c6","uuid":"37d8fac0-e072-4a66-8887-47a4556f5403","timestamp":"2026-11-05T14:34:34.212Z","request_id":"req_011CgjwsNWW4ZeVUrSWV1mgx"}
