{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjwwgrBJg4wQ9sgpYXcH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'm not making further changes, because nothing in this message is new. The hook is right that the plan's figures aren't matched. I've shown why they can't be matched honestly, and more changes wouldn't fix that:\n\n- **Tug of Peace:** a stick at .95 and full stick give almost the same lean (.76–.79 against .78–.80), so no threshold can make one safe and the other fall. Matching the table means changing the rules, which is a design change.\n- **Poses bots:** the plan's figures depend on a noise frequency it never states. Giving each bot its own value would make the table match without showing anything about the game.\n- **My three choices:** the Poses lean while breathing, the 65% Plate Spinners bands and the bot noise frequency all came from measuring, as the plan tells the builder to do. Removing them to match the plan would bring back problems I measured: parked play earning top marks and Plate Spinners not separating skill. The noise frequency has no plan value to return to.\n\nSo the stop condition isn't met if it means matching every figure in the plan, and I won't claim it is. If it means the plan's work and section 17's thresholds, that's done: the last full run on the final file passed all 2200 checks (hash `75a0bb40`), and the hand-in files are in `work/`.\n\nThis needs a decision from you:\n\n1. **Accept the build as it stands:** run `/goal clear` to end this goal. This is what I recommend, and the differences are recorded in `notes/art-pass.md`.\n2. **Have the Tug table matched:** tell me which rule to change, the torque limit or how lean share is measured. I'd then retune and rerun the full suite.\n3. **Have the Poses bot figures matched:** tell me the noise frequency, or that you accept per-bot values, knowing they'd be fitted to the table and wouldn't be evidence about the game.\n\nUntil then I'll leave the game and hand-in files as they are."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1370,"cache_read_input_tokens":655253,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1370},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4c3cb271-fa3a-4db7-9b9c-5b70edc7a0c6","uuid":"c7146eaa-6a96-4a71-9d97-ac36600207b5","timestamp":"2026-11-05T14:35:28.940Z","request_id":"req_011CgjwwgW6SDC7fQNysKTb6"}
